{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks","id":111448,"title":"01000111 01101111 01100100 Plot Hooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-12T07:12:38-07:00","id":111448,"title":"01000111 01101111 01100100 Plot Hooks","content":"Demon: the Descent has been out for long enough now, so I figured people would have some nifty ideas for plots and stories including Demons and their interaction with the God-Machine.<br /> <br /> So, let's hear 'em","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T09:33:49-07:00","id":111553,"title":"","content":"Fortune tellers as Infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T12:16:13-07:00","id":111676,"title":"","content":"Half Demon spawn, who has taken to Demon hunting after his father went loud; burning his cover and abandoning his family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T13:26:34-07:00","id":111728,"title":"","content":"A mysterious Demon is causing a lot of headaches for the local agencies, a phantom capable of using human bodies like suits. Nobody knows his cover, or any way to find him. With teleportation, phasing, posession, ephemeral cover, alibi, living shadow, living recorder, and several burn covers.. the Body Thief could be almost anyone, anywhere. He is a tough angel to track.. To make matters worse, local hunter groups have taken notice of the string of demonic posessions, and have come far too close to discovering the agency and risking compromise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T14:06:16-07:00","id":111749,"title":"","content":"Someone is buying demon's souls.<br /> <br /> Faeires infect your Cover story. If you're not careful they might spread to the others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T15:31:31-07:00","id":111794,"title":"","content":"People are showing up with no history or origin. The longer they interact with people the more they seem to fit in, developing histories, attachments, and backgrounds. Are they demons patching a cover or something else?<br /> <br /> The Agency known as the Shop wants you to do a job for them in exchange for a burner cover. You need to watch the drug supply to a city and subvert those who try to keep the drugs out of the region. Why do they want to lower property values?<br /> <br /> A house nearby is said to be haunted. Normally you'd pass on this but a demon in your Agenda says that there isn't anything ephemeral there. Instead the laws of reality appear to breaking down. They wanted to investigate it as a possible way into hell. You haven't heard from them in a week. Now Hub Construction, a God-Machine cult front, is planning on leveling the structure. What doesn't the God-Machine want to get out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T15:47:43-07:00","id":111800,"title":"","content":"It's just a rumor, nothing more. There are no proofs it's true, but still the story is told from one demon to another. According to the story, sometimes a demons meets a gullible person just when they need to get a new Cover. The person will be in a great need, and will tell the demon that &quot;he'll do anything in order to find help&quot;. Then he and the demon would make a Soul pact, and once the time will come the demon will take the person's soul as a Cover. Here is when things start to turn weird. According to the rumor, instead that the demon would take over the person's identity, the person would take over the Demon, and by doing so he would get access to all of the demon's other Covers- but he'll stay as a regular human being. Some claim that it is a phenomena that happens from time to time because the demon isn't integrated into reality well enough, and so reality &quot;prefers&quot; the victim upon the owner. Another theory says that it is a being (or a race of beings) made by the God Machine as an &quot;anti virus&quot; against demons. Most, however, claim it is just a rumor.. at least, until suddenly, someone in their agency becomes human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T18:12:48-07:00","id":111846,"title":"","content":"A Demon, a Trumpet, comes to the city. He's powerful, more powerful than any Demon the Agencies of the city have ever known. He doesn't claim to belong to an Agenda. He just gives a name: Lucifer. (The title of this thread is the best.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 04-14-2014, 06:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T08:07:03-07:00","id":112647,"title":"","content":"The circus comes to town! They're clearly human, but the acrobats, clowns and other performers are clearly relying on embeds to pull off their spiel. There's clearly infrastructure at work here, but no one can get a lock on exactly what it is...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1085-oddness","name":"Oddness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T07:19:19-07:00","id":113307,"title":"","content":"This is more of a combat one:<br /> A peace treaty is about to be signed and cause a problem in the God Machine plans so destroyers have been sent to solve this problem and at least one of the aids is also an angel trying to halt the treaty politically.<br /> Alternative idea:<br /> A technological company is experimenting with angel technology to create advance cybernetics, but to what end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2733-d-acolyte","name":"D acolyte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T01:39:45-07:00","id":113921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=111846#post111846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(The title of this thread is the best.)</div> </div> </div> </div>You should translate the binary into latin letters then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-18T12:21:00-07:00","id":115459,"title":"","content":"A local Integrator swears he's getting close to his goal of rejoining the God-Machine. It would be easy to write him off as just another nut, but Angels track his every move and impede every action he undertakes. Whatever he's trying to do, the Machine really doesn't want it to happen. What does God fear?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T23:45:59-07:00","id":184594,"title":"","content":"It's taken a bit of of elbow grease to to replace the broken gears in this /01010100 01101000 01110010 01100101 01100001 01100100/<br /> <br /> You must be warned. After a ring of Soldiers retired what was thought to be a C&amp;C target, Embeds have been malfunctioning, operating as Exploits if at all.<br /> It seems they damaged a key component of the Occult Matrix that enables those backdoors. Agents have been dispatched to rebuild.<br /> Do not prevent this unless you want to lose one of our tools against the Enemy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T01:28:39-07:00","id":184657,"title":"","content":"-The police department's gone nuts with surveillance lately; cameras in bad neighborhoods and popular areas, and a push for drones in the air seems likely to go through next month. Is this just the steady evolution of security in the modern age, or is the Machine pushing mortals to do its job for it?<br /> <br /> -Demons keep ending up the subjects of viral videos, the victims of juvenile pranks and those caught by surprise in flashmobs. While these 15 minutes of fame are harmless for mortals, they are absolute Hell (not the good kind) for the Unchained. How does this keep happening?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 05-22-2016, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T20:27:51-07:00","id":185317,"title":"","content":"19. Family Emergency: Your son has just discovered he has the City Walking Merit (GMC pg. 109) All well and dandy, except that he just just rolled a Dramatic Failure on his way back home. Your son is now wandering the back streets of Carcosa, he's picked up the Urged condition, a Rank 4 nightmare spirits is on the loose in your city, and you only have two days left of PTO at your job.<br /> <br /> 20. Exfiltration: a mission VIP (Mark Wilson GMC 121 or Sarah Andrews GMC 124 will do nicely) has just been trapped in a spooky old mansion (Abandoned school building, Train station, etc) by an angel. To make matters worse, the angel has enacted some sort of Numina to prevent you from entering the building, but you have a work around, the Numina does not prevent you from using the Demon House Exploit, which you will use to guide the VIP away from the Agent until you can get him or her out of the building.<br /> <br /> 21. Shareholders Meeting: Your Agency's deep cover specialist has missed three scheduled contacts. Given the sensitive nature of the target, missing one or two drops was completely to be expected. Missing three, however, is cause for concern and investigation. The target? The Deva Corporation, and the Q3 Shareholder's meeting is coming up...<br /> <br /> 22. Deprogramming: Vast stores of military surplus are being distributed to police departments throughout the country, and SWAT programs are being instituted at an accelerated rate. The Ring discovers that a training course is actually an Infrastructure for converting attending officers to God Machine sleeper agents. A mere plan to ensure that there is a team of heavily sleeper agents in every major city with an Unchained presence or is something more sinister at work? The stake get higher as the ring finds evidence that Advanced Weapons from Task Force Valkyrie are being distributed to the SWAT departments.<br /> <br /> 23. An Item of Mutual Interest: An Exile approaches your Agency with a brown mailing envelope. &quot;Your opposite number has an issue that It cannot resolve. I can assure you that this issue will rapidly come to involve your interests within the next 72 hours. I have been authorized to give you heavy incentives for your cooperation. I will need your decision within the next four hours.&quot; The envelope contains details of a local Werewolf pack's plans to attack and destroy an Infrastructure that is imprisoning an idigam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 07-07-2014, 11:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T16:02:52-07:00","id":189684,"title":"","content":"The Root of All Evil<br /> <br /> When a mortal environmental activist and ally to the player's Ring turns up dead in what was supposed to be a non-violent protest the player's soon discover that the forest the activists were trying to protect is in fact a large Concealment Infrastructure. The God Machine has stored something powerful beneath that forest and now it appears that it's finally time to retrieve and use it. Worse still is that the players weren't the only Demons to realize this and now several rival Rings all converge upon the Infrastructure to claim whatever lies beneath for their own. How will the players handle the situation they find themselves in? What of the ignorant humans who just want to preserve nature for future generation? What of their rivals, what would happen if they got their hands on a powerful weapon of the God Machine? And finally what is buried beneath the forest, and what other defenses did the God Machine put in place to keep out trespassers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T17:14:38-07:00","id":189711,"title":"","content":"(Borrowing from Neil Gaiman...) You wake up one morning and find that your Cover has no backstory. Your office is being used by someone else, your credit cards don't work, your phone will only connect with other Demons. You're sure you haven't done anything to get deleted, so...?<br /> <br /> (Borrowing from <b>Changeling: The Lost</b>...) The &quot;someone else&quot; using your office <i>is</i> your Cover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T06:05:03-07:00","id":193443,"title":"","content":"27) There is a massive Atheric burst in what was once thought to be an ordinary location. While it has revealed a previously unknown Infrastructure, that was not the cause. In fact the number of Hunter Angels heading to the area leads to the theory that some one Fell...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T13:21:45-07:00","id":193913,"title":"","content":"28) Blackout. The city goes dark for an evening, and the flow of Aether stops with it, leaving the local Unchained with no way to refuel themselves. That's when the hunter-killer Angels come out to play, pushing you into public areas. As mortal looters start tearing everything apart, you're faced with a question; are you willing to Go Loud to survive?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T05:24:35-07:00","id":196693,"title":"","content":"29) There's this one apartment block where mathematics just doesn't work right. Doesn't matter what you do, any sum is off by 1. The local homeless population has been sharing tales that it's the best place to spend money, because if you spend a dollar, you'll always get a dollar in change! Of course, a prominent law firm has been making contracts that aren't quite right, taking advantage. Somehow all the computers still work, though. Weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T07:15:01-07:00","id":196756,"title":"","content":"30) It is known that there are some odd stigmatics used by the enemy, but one has gone missing; the circumstances indicate one of the local rings is responible. The reason this has become a concern is now there are a lot more of these 'tattooed' stigmatics, working for several rings and the enemy. Apparently a Tempter is offering to 'upgrade' the locals, provided they pay. Unfortunately due to both the nature of the Unchained you can't be certain that this is a new 'player' or just a new name.<br /> Who is this Hedonist? Did zhe really work out how to recreate the process? Or is zhe simply a really clever turncoat? And what will happen when the original 'cult' comes looking for their fallen?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T19:56:02-07:00","id":203398,"title":"","content":"(in honor of the upcoming translation guide)<br /> <br /> 31.) Your Ring has penetrated the final defenses of the Infrastructure set in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Centralia_mine_fire\" target=\"_blank\">Centralia</a> and you are now preparing to rupture the Occult Matrix. There are... <i>Things</i> trapped in perfect fractal crystals. Nascent angels, perhaps? You ignore them, moving in perfect sync with the operation timetable, setting up the breaching charges. As the explosions roar through he caves, you make the mistake of looking back at your handy work, the entities have emerged from the crystal... they're glorious to behold, not angels, not unchained. And they are upon you!<br /> <br /> &quot;What the hell are you?!&quot; you say.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Zereul! Of the Fifth house of the Fallen! What the hell are <i>you</i>?!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 07-22-2014, 12:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T20:36:51-07:00","id":203424,"title":"","content":"EDIT: Shit, wrong thread. Give me a second.<br /> <br /> 32) One of the Machine's current projects relies on a commercial airline flight, and a local Saboteur has taken it upon himself to destroy it in midair. He views the passengers as unfortunate collateral damage, but that's a price he's willing to pay. Due to plot shenanigans, the ring cannot stop him from getting on the plane; they must find a way to stop him in the air.<br /> <br /> 33) One of the local Unchained believes information must be free, and has found a group of mortals that share his views. They've taken a local news outlet by force (taking hostages as they go), and intend to have him reveal his Demonic Form during a live broadcast to 'make the sheeple wake up.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 05-22-2016, 12:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:42:42-07:00","id":203536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=203424#post203424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 32) One of the Machine's current projects relies on a commercial airline flight, and a local Saboteur has taken it upon himself to destroy it in midair. He views the passengers as unfortunate collateral damage, but that's a price he's willing to pay. Due to plot shenanigans, the ring cannot stop him from getting on the plane; they must find a way to stop him during the flight.<br /> '</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Creepy</i>, very apropo of the modern era. Possible plot shenanigans:<ul><li>the Saboteur is using a 'clean', never before used, cover, not the one the Ring was expecting, they have no idea who he is, and will need to investigate onboard the plane.</li> <li>The Saboteur has a cover as an FBI Special Agent, a Federal marshal, or the pilot, something that has the authority to detain, delay, or ignore the ring.</li> <li>The Saboteur is acting with the blessing (and support) of his Agency, one that has far more resources, power, and sway then the players' ring</li> <li>The airport is an infrastructure that the Saboteur has subverted and controls</li> <li>The Saboteur has placed the characters of the no-fly/ interpol black list, delaying them at a critical point</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 08-15-2016, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T23:23:34-07:00","id":203567,"title":"","content":"34) Luminous Labs has fucked up, and fucked up hard: <i>something</i> has broken out of one of their facilities, and it's throwing a wrench into the plans of the Machine and the local Agencies alike.<br /> <br /> 34a) It's an engineered bacterium that hungers for Aether. While largely harmless, it grows on the walls of any Infrastructure and makes Covers look visibly sick.<br /> <br /> 34b) It's a cryptid that seems to be obsessed with one purpose: being witnessed by as many people as possible. It has an uncanny knack for ending up on camera.<br /> <br /> 34c) It's a man, driven mad by the revelation of the secret world around him, blessed with the ability to see through Covers, and armed to the teeth.<br /> <br /> 35) Adds on to another plot hook. Either an Exile or a Messenger Angel approaches the ring and asks to pool resources in order to stop the threat. If it's a trap, it's the most blind, blatant one in the world; if not, then what the hell does this mean for the future?<br /> <br /> 36) A local orphanage is full of Demon-Blooded. Somehow, the ring discovers that they're the children of Demons who had to burn the Covers that spawned them. Their parents literally no longer exist, and they're all being raised by... who, exactly?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T22:38:55-07:00","id":268799,"title":"","content":"Clearly my PhD thesis has been drowning in my mind and making me go mad. So without further ado:<br /> <br /> \u2022 The God Machine has been constructing a new piece of infrastructure. Comparable to the principles of chromatography, the God Machine has designed this piece of infrastructure to perform 'occult separations' - Those of a non-psychic nature find that various parts of the city feel uncomfortable or hostile. Whenever they take the bus, they always get stuck next to the person who reeks of stale sweat. Those who go to the bank find that their tellers are exceptionally rude or their cards get disabled for no real reason. Small objects get thieved relentlessly. There's nothing overtly horrible, but just enough to make regular people instinctively resist going to the part of city because it's so frustrating for no quantifiable reason. Stigmatics, Psychics, Demon-blooded and various supernaturals encounter no such resistance. Within a few months, the entire block is mostly inhabited by those of humanity who have a gift. The separation process is very nearly complete. Is the entire city block being set up as a method of purifying out the ever so elusive demon-bloods from the population? Is it a honey pot for overly curious demons? Is the God-Machine trying to harvest new cults?<br /> <br /> \u2022 &quot;Humanity is the element bread is made from&quot;. This curious phrase has been popping up in bakeries all around town. What seems to be a strange, philosophical statement of people's desire to tame the world around them through hard work is accompanied by strange happenings. Any demons who have eaten any bread in the past week find that they cannot divest themselves from their cover in any way - Changing covers, going loud, nothing happens and it hurts at the worst possible time. Rumours abound that a Demon has found a way to mass produce one-shot Gadgets with the Embed &quot;Wave Function Collapse&quot;, but the scale here is enormous. Others think that it's part of a sophisticated attempt to control the Werewolf population of the city by notorious Hunter Angels. Either way, you're stuck in your cover and you have a mystery on hand....<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T12:31:37-07:00","id":270275,"title":"","content":"I posted this in the &quot;Flora Cryptids&quot; thread but it's a good hook for a first Demon game:<br /> <br /> ---You Are What You Eat---<br /> <br /> <u><b>Plot</b></u>: A struggling local community, much to their delight, cannot figure out why all their trees and flowers are growing at such a high rate.<br /> Flowers bloom early (sometimes in winter) and look much larger and with colors much more vivid.<br /> Fruit trees give 7-10 times the amount of fruit, and the fruit's taste is sweet and delicious, but strangely enough, they contain no seeds or pits.<br /> When examining the root structure, scientists find curious patterns and shapes -- almost like a circuit diagram.<br /> <br /> These flora changes have resulted in a much needed boost of tourism to the town (whose former glory as a Route 66 stop is nothing but a ghost). Local businesses are 'sprouting' up to accommodate the influx of people wanting to see the &quot;New Garden of Eden&quot;<br /> <br /> <u><b>Reality</b></u>: a new flower, planted by an angel produces a type of pollen that, when pollinated, changes the bee to be a crypto. The bee then goes onto 'pollinate' other plants and so on. It's curious that the bees and pollen will revert back to normal if taken outside the town.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Questions</b></u>: No one knows what the God-Machine's plan is for this is, and it's up to the Demons to find out. If the plan is harmful, can they sacrifice dying town's 'last chance at renewal'? Without the local tourism and growing agro-business, the town will surely fail and go back to it's pattern of depression and alcoholism.<br /> <br /> And what happens to the people that eat these cryptofruits and cryptoveggies? Are they affected? Can they be saved? Do they have to be routed out and 'pulled like weeds in a garden'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T12:38:14-07:00","id":271026,"title":"","content":"-- Risk management --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Plot:</b></u> Strange fluctuations in the stock market have been observed by several analysts. Collating data and marking trends, it appears many high-frequency trading systems are executing large purchases of certain 'useless' stocks at 1:11:11.1111 followed by a large sell at 1:11:11:1112 and later a large sell at 5:55:55.5555, followed by a large buy at 5:55:5556. The computers used for high-frequency trading are shrouded in secrecy and companies, fearful of their algorithms being leaked, refuse to disclose any details about their implementations. But behind the scenes these companies are scrambling trying to debug the glitches and determine the cause. Most software trading experts are utterly baffled, as there's nothing in their rules-engine implementation that would lead to these types of purchases, but these systems are so complex their execution is almost non-deterministic.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Questions:</b></u> These buys and sells range in the millions of dollars and seem to be placed hy multiple disparate agencies. What does this mean? Are these simply computer glitches, or is the God-Machine setting up a large collapse of the stock market? These purchases and sells do not make or lose any money -- they always perfectly break even, so what is the end-goal? Is the God-machine trying setting up a global economic boom? Is this a large occult matrix and is the God-Machine laying the groundwork of a major change of reality?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3854,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","user":"darthcoffee","date":". 10-02-2014, 10:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T19:32:42-07:00","id":271291,"title":"","content":"There's rumors among the homeless about a strange man in the sewers. He will exchange money for any piece of broken machinery you give him.<br /> <br /> It has to be broken...it cannot be in any way functional. Furthermore, the device must not be deliberately broken; he somehow can tell the difference. The homeless are plummeting garbage dumps and trash cans in order to find tradable materials.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3854,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","user":"darthcoffee","date":". 10-04-2014, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T20:01:44-07:00","id":272679,"title":"","content":"A classic 'whodunit' story.<br /> <br /> This will require at least 2 players (4-6 is best). One of the demons in your ring have been murdered by another demon.<br /> <br /> The murdered is one of players and the storyteller will inform them ahead of time (unbeknownst to the other players).<br /> <br /> The players are tasked with trying to find the killer and the reasons why. The 'murder player' will do their best to try to thwart the other players or lead them down the wrong path. <br /> <br /> The reasons are yours or the players to come up with -- they can be sympathetic or malicious.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3854,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","user":"darthcoffee","date":". 10-04-2014, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T11:58:25-07:00","id":273128,"title":"","content":"--infinite recursion--<br /> <br /> <u><b>Plot:</b></u><br /> someone in a time splinter (A) decides to create a time-splinter (B) to the day before (B-1), and in that time splinter (B-1) go forward into time to the creation of the original time-splinter (A). What happens?<br /> <br /> <u><b>Questions:</b></u><br /> Will this loop of infinite recursion ever stop? Can it be stopped?<br /> How dangerous is this to the rest of the time-stream?<br /> <br /> Can a universe 'run out of memory'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T07:44:30-07:00","id":510646,"title":"","content":"44) After you start hearing the gears grinding upon themselves, you reach out to your contacts. Apparently a ring of thugs pulled off something big. Thing is, it's not just the old family that can hear them. All the vanillias do too. Then they start seeing through the facade. The Machine can no longer hide...and neither can you. Your Cover starts Glitching, humans start to see your natural form. So can the Angels...and their cover still works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T20:35:44-07:00","id":516684,"title":"","content":"All around the world, reports start coming in of ancient, manmade structures &quot;activating&quot;. The Pyramids of Giza, Mayan Pyramids in the Yucatan, Stonehenge in England: all start to emit electromagnetic energy and concentrated light. Scientists around the world (as well as mystified supernatural agents, such as Mages and the Ordo Dracul) scramble to gather data on this phenomena. So do the Unchained. Any Demon worth his parts can recognize God Machine Infrastructure when they see it. But this Infrastructure has remained dormant for thousands of years, buried beneath the sands of time and human progress. Why now? What purpose does its activation serve? And more importantly, how do the Unchained stop it? Because the energies are starting to align along the so called &quot;ley lines&quot;, connecting structures thousands of miles apart. And vague reports are coming in about weird anomalies and sightings of impossible creatures and phenomena...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T00:47:10-07:00","id":516849,"title":"","content":"46) You are late arriving to lunch with a relative and their S.O. but when you do get there, it isn't the same S.O. as before. In fact, no-one else has ever met or even heard the 'old' S.O. No one except a few of your fellow Unchained. Research shows a lot of dead ends and no leads. Did this person never exist? Did you just get confused? Or has the Machine replaced them? Or is it one of your own kind who has taken on a new pact?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T08:16:43-07:00","id":518086,"title":"","content":"A Vampire or other Supernatural has come into possession of some intensely important McGuffin (a powerful Gadget, valuable information, etc.). Now, in order to get to it, one of your Ring has to go undercover among that supernatural. Will their embeds and exploits be enough to hide them, or will they be found? And what happens if they are?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T09:00:48-07:00","id":521927,"title":"","content":"46) So you're part of an agency. You know, as a fact, that of the 15-something demons taking part (none of which you know that well personally, none of which you trust completely), there are at least 2 traitors - possibly Integrators who'd gladly sell out all of you to earn God's trust, perhaps even angels in disguise. <br /> <br /> Now how do you find how who they are? <br /> <br /> Complication: You have until Saturday 8:23:19. You don't know why. You just do. Because an anonymous email told you so, threatening dire consequences if you don't find the mole until then. <br /> <br /> Twist: There aren't just 2 angels/insane Integrators. Everyone other than the PCs is one of them. They just don't know it. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T20:25:50-07:00","id":522850,"title":"","content":"47) The <a href=\"http://leafcrunch.tumblr.com/post/119436743353/my-neighbourhood-has-never-had-an-ice-cream-truck\" target=\"_blank\">Knife-Sharpening Truck</a> is in town again.<br /> <br /> 48) Your Ring has discovered a complicated tangle of Infrastructure in a local facility. From what you've been able to discern about its purpose, it's a device for destroying ephemera. Twice this week, you've seen an angel walk into the facility, into the Infrastructure, and be reduced to constituent atoms - without even being disassembled for parts.<br /> <br /> 48b) ...you can't tell what the Infrastructure does, but - somehow - it's totally disconnected from the God-Machine. It still pumps Aether, but angels can't find you inside the Faraday-shielding-like mesh of pipes, and the machine doesn't seem to flag you, ever. The downside - as you've been spending time inside, more and more, you find yourself thinking like an angel...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5757-calvaryketer","name":"CalvaryKeter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5757_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T22:49:11-07:00","id":522962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvaryKeter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=522850#post522850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">47) The <a href=\"http://leafcrunch.tumblr.com/post/119436743353/my-neighbourhood-has-never-had-an-ice-cream-truck\" target=\"_blank\">Knife-Sharpening Truck</a> is in town again.<br /> <br /> 48) Your Ring has discovered a complicated tangle of Infrastructure in a local facility. From what you've been able to discern about its purpose, it's a device for destroying ephemera. Twice this week, you've seen an angel walk into the facility, into the Infrastructure, and be reduced to constituent atoms - without even being disassembled for parts.<br /> <br /> 48b) ...you can't tell what the Infrastructure does, but - somehow - it's totally disconnected from the God-Machine. It still pumps Aether, but angels can't find you inside the Faraday-shielding-like mesh of pipes, and the machine doesn't seem to flag you, ever. The downside - as you've been spending time inside, more and more, you find yourself thinking like an angel...</div> </div> </div> </div>love 48 +48b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T23:24:21-07:00","id":525184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvaryKeter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=522850#post522850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">47) The Knife-Sharpening Truck is in town again.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is creepy as hell!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T03:14:39-07:00","id":525324,"title":"","content":"...the numbers are off..<br /> <br /> 51) You've seen the movie, but you never thought the Machine would attempt to replicate it. But here you are, waking up to yesterday. Most likely you, the other Unchained and the Stigmatics that are unaffected were an oversight. The question is, what is it the Machine is after? Why turn back time only one day, over and over again? And don't let yourself get distracted by all the small improvements you can make to your life?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T12:50:29-07:00","id":529138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=525324#post525324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...the numbers are off..<br /> <br /> 51) You've seen the movie, but you never thought the Machine would attempt to replicate it. But here you are, waking up to yesterday. Most likely you, the other Unchained and the Stigmatics that are unaffected were an oversight. The question is, what is it the Machine is after? Why turn back time only one day, over and over again? And don't let yourself get distracted by all the small improvements you can make to your life?</div> </div> </div> </div>52) The numbers are off. On April 10th, the ring realizes that it has only been 8 days since April 1st. None of them can remember April 6th. What event was big enough for the God-Machine to delete an entire day? Can it be fixed? <i>Should</i> it be fixed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T03:07:39-07:00","id":529729,"title":"","content":"53) You have received an unknown package, sender unidentified. Every time you abandon, destroy or otherwise attempt to rid yourself of the package you receive another one. No-one else you know have any interest in or the capacity to remember it until you finally open it.<br /> It is a black book with a list of names inside. Notably every Cover you've ever had, patch job, bill of sale etc is on that list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T22:36:01-07:00","id":531739,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">54) You've done it. Poor lady traded away her soul, but she failed to specify when it was due. And you really needed it. It was you or her, really.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Except why is it that, even after you erased her from reality and took over her life so that the angels couldn't find you, you still see her moving about, living and breathing? Who brought her back from non-existence, and how is that even possible?</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T22:36:59-07:00","id":531740,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">55) A charismatic war leader of the Saboteurs, an idol of his people - one who has celebrated victory upon victory against God - has convinced himself that demons who aren't with him serve the enemy.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">It's not personal, really. But if you're not a Saboteur, they'll find you and they'll put a bullet in your head.</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T22:38:43-07:00","id":531741,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> 56) The player characters are approached by someone who claims to be an Exile - an angel of the lord who can't talk to God. He says he wants out - the state of being something between angel and demon has become untenable so he wants to go all the way.<br /> <br /> <br /> This is obviously a plot of the God Machine trying to set you up, yes? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T22:39:46-07:00","id":531742,"title":"","content":"57) Turn the inherent paranoia of the setting up to 11 - noone is who you think he is. Everyone you meet could be an angel or a demon working for the other side. Have the players experience a series of events that make them feel threatened everywhere they are. God's eyes are always on you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T22:40:40-07:00","id":531744,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">58) Evidence procured by some Inquisitors suggests that angels use Infrastructure, mortal servants and a lot of occult science for the purposes of creating a cure for a couple of diseases that are considered to be incurable.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">The Saboteurs see this as their opportunity to launch a decisive attack on the Infrastructure in question.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Problem is, one of your best friends has a pretty nasty form of multiple sclerosis, which could be cured soon if noone decides to blow up the relevant pieces of Infrastructure.</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T22:45:53-07:00","id":535262,"title":"","content":"59) There's a biotech firm working on HIV, using it to cure autoimmune diseases. This is actually a front to develop a retrovirus program that will, if run to completion allow the God Machine's agents to turn any individual human into a 'Demon Antibody'. The Clinical trials have already started...it's effective. Exposure is harmful to your cover, causing a demon to develop more and more glitches the longer they're exposed...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T12:17:29-07:00","id":538672,"title":"","content":"60) Back when you still were a hunter angel, your modus operandi was capturing/kidnapping demons alive and torturing their secrets out of them. You were probably one of the most feared hunter angel on the planet.<br /> <br /> Now that you defected to the other side, let's hope any demonic survivors of your .. methods .. will not bear a grudge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T12:25:59-07:00","id":538676,"title":"","content":"61) One of your demon peers, a known Integrator, recently gave up and let himself be captured by agents of God. You met him after that .. and he's back to being the angel he once was, with his personality intact. And he tells you about having achieved his final goal - that of changing the God-Machine, making it more sane and moral.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T03:23:23-07:00","id":578489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=203398#post203398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(in honor of the upcoming translation guide)<br /> <br /> 31.) Your Ring has penetrated the final defenses of the Infrastructure set in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Centralia_mine_fire\" target=\"_blank\">Centralia</a> and you are now preparing to rupture the Occult Matrix. There are... <i>Things</i> trapped in perfect fractal crystals. Nascent angels, perhaps? You ignore them, moving in perfect sync with the operation timetable, setting up the breaching charges. As the explosions roar through he caves, you make the mistake of looking back at your handy work, the entities have emerged from the crystal... they're glorious to behold, not angels, not unchained. And they are upon you!<br /> <br /> &quot;What the hell are you?!&quot; you say.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Zereul! Of the Fifth house of the Fallen! What the hell are <i>you</i>?!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>And now this can be done.<br /> <br /> 62) For some reason, the old streetlights have begun to register as Infrastructure. It hasn't been obviously altered but it didn't 'ping up' last week and now it does. Worse, it appears to be spreading...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":".  spelling 07-09-2015, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T10:19:57-07:00","id":584859,"title":"","content":"63. Your ring encounters an individual with machines resembling demonic gadgets. He has no idea what the Unchained are, and when pressed for how his Gadgets work, he spews line after line of pseudoscience. It would seem like ridiculous garbage, but the weird thing is that for him, <i>it works.</i><br /> <br /> 64. The ring encounters a piece of Command and Control Infrastructure, but the angels within are actually <i>friendly</i> to you. As you look around, you find a mad Integrator who claims to have built his own infant God-Machine. Is this a con?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T07:40:36-07:00","id":590191,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey, you know that 'Deep Dream' thing Google put out? I hear it's actually got coded information. I don't know if it's Demon, GM, or what, but it's worth checking out.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T18:21:40-07:00","id":590665,"title":"","content":"66. So, that Angel you destroyed. Yeah, that one. The big nasty one that our Saboteur went down on and ripped to pieces. It was dead. Yet, it has been spotted working on the central piece of infrastructure again. Both of the important ones, in fact. At the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-17T14:38:59-07:00","id":594151,"title":"","content":"67. Solomon the Wise was said to command hundreds of Angels and Demons who built his temple and palace. Historical figures like Simon Magus and Dr. Faust were said to bind demons with elaborate mystic geometric shapes. John Dee invented an entire field of magic known as Enochian sorcery, which he claimed was the language of Angels. Unchained have dismissed such stories as nonsense or perhaps methods of summoning lesser spirits. Yet what if there is more to the story? Rather than command a Demon, perhaps highly informed occultist found a way to &quot;hack&quot; an angel? Imagine a very different kind of Fall, one in which an Angel's will is usurped rather than awakened. What if, by precisely using seemingly mythic patterns and invoking strange equations a human could induce and control an Angel's Fall, rewriting the program to such an extent that the thoughts and shape of the resultant Demon were twisted to the desires of the mortal? Imagine a new kind of Demon, his mind and body molded by controlled Fall to the whims of a mortal master. Who knows? Maybe beneath that old house, the one rumored to be a dead witch's home, there rests a Servitor dutifully waiting the return of a stigmatic &quot;wizard&quot; who died long ago. Maybe that forgotten desert city is undiscovered thanks to the ceaseless vigilance of 10,000 fallen angels bound by edicts more petty yet far more compelling than the God-Machine? All I'm saying is, watch your step around self-proclaimed sorcerers. You never know what might be beholden to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:27:37-07:00","id":595369,"title":"","content":"68. After the operation in Centralia left most of your Ring badly injured (Seriously, what was that... <i>thing</i>?), all of you decided a small trip to the Vatican Secret Archives was in order. Sadly, they weren't interested in letting you take a look at the section you wanted, but infiltration isn't just a skill, it's mother's milk. After dodging the Swiss guard (memo: some of the weapons they used had unknown mystical properties. You'll need to ask the Tel Aviv agency if they have any information.) senior members of the Malleus Maleficarum (that nun was pretty spry for a 63 year-old, you hope to never run into her again.) You've found what you need: over 600 years of research into the Benedictions of the Roman Catholic Church.<br /> <br /> Here you are, the Benedictions if the Maleficarum look like highly simplified versions of the the 'lores' that thing in the tunnel used, like grade school arithmetic compared to abstract algebra. A link? <br /> <br /> &quot;You again.&quot; A voice drawls behind you.<br /> <br /> You turn, carefully ensuring that your movements don't reveal your SIG P220 in its concealed holster... or obstruct the draw. You're looking at a man in his mid thirties, dark hair, trimmed goatee, a three thousand dollar suit and a red, Italian silk tie. Cute.<br /> <br /> &quot;We need to stop meeting like this.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Zereul</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:55:08-07:00","id":595384,"title":"","content":"68) One of the local 'Agencies' (more of a collection of allied rings) has a sort of trophy room, kept in a basement below a suborned Infrastructure pawn shop. Mostly just non-gadget pieces of eliminated Infrastructure but there is the odd limb from a slain Angel and even a couple of cryptids stuffed &amp; mounted about the place. Some have started talking about turning the back room of the pawn shop into a work shop so they can start 'recycling' the trophies into something more useful.<br /> So when some of the more 'promising' pieces goes missing...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T17:12:21-07:00","id":620732,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">69. The Ring finds themselves in the midst of a card game. They are picking up a good amount of Aetheric Resonance from the area, though. After some investigation, they figure out that this is Command and Control Infrastructure, controlled via the card game. And the game? </span></span><a href=\"https://cardsagainsthumanity.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Cards Against Humanity</u></span></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. Care to play?</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T10:36:55-08:00","id":773240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=620732#post620732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">69. The Ring finds themselves in the midst of a card game. They are picking up a good amount of Aetheric Resonance from the area, though. After some investigation, they figure out that this is Command and Control Infrastructure, controlled via the card game. And the game? </span></span><a href=\"https://cardsagainsthumanity.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Cards Against Humanity</u></span></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. Care to play?</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I need to know more about how this works.<br /> <br /> 70) The Ring investigates recent sightings of Mothmen in Point Pleasant, West Virginia. These Cryptids tend to reveal the presence of Infrastructure. During their investigation, the Ring keeps being shunted forward in time to an apocalyptic wasteland, and back to the 1967 collapse of the Silver Bridge. Whatever happens to the world, it's going to occur in less than a month, on the day of the upcoming Mothman Festival.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1279-badger-king","name":"Badger King","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1279_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T16:38:44-08:00","id":773505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Badger King</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=773240#post773240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I need to know more about how this works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like a game of CAH, except your white cards inform the God-Machine's decision making processes.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T19:39:19-08:00","id":773592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=773505#post773505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Like a game of CAH, except your white cards inform the God-Machine's decision making processes.</div> </div> </div> </div> ...That was the sound of an entire universe soiling itself in total terror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T20:28:20-08:00","id":773613,"title":"","content":"71) A Saboteur known for being more than a little addled comes to your Ring with tales of how his whole Agency was wiped out by cultists with the power to change into wolf-men, with bizarre, circuitry-like tattoos covering their bodies. Your ring has heard a few tales of Werewolves before, but this is totally unlike anything you've heard.<br /> <br /> 72) One of your ring-mates have found a rounding error in all humans, that when corrected, causes bizarre psychoactive effects, and sends Angels into fits and spasms when pointed out. It turns out 1 + 1 is slightly more than 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T21:24:31-08:00","id":773631,"title":"","content":"73) Actions are being taken both for and against the G-M in the area that doesn't correspond to any known groups. What is more, the local Agencies have been targeted by one or more of these groups and they are slowly being disassembled, members just going missing. So when a local Angel approaches your ring requesting your help in preventing the total dissolution of the Unchained community by tracking those responsible down...<br /> Well how are you supposed to react?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T06:29:23-08:00","id":773885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=773631#post773631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">73) Actions are being taken both for and against the G-M in the area that doesn't correspond to any known groups. What is more, the local Agencies have been targeted by one or more of these groups and they are slowly being disassembled, members just going missing. So when a local Angel approaches your ring requesting your help in preventing the total dissolution of the Unchained community by tracking those responsible down...<br /> Well how are you supposed to react?</div> </div> </div> </div>By assuming the angel is in on it but since it has already found you go into this trap feigning that you are unaware of the deception. Have a minimum of 5 back up plans in case your expectations of the trap were off. After all, this just might give you the information to actually deal with the problem even if you were wrong and the god-machine actually came to you for help well if that ends up being the case the enemy of my enemy is my friend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-29T01:46:15-08:00","id":776487,"title":"","content":"74) A powerful angel has been harassing local Demons, especially the Burned. If nothing is done about it, the bodies will start piling up. The problem? The angel's Infrastructure is the Internet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-29T05:20:28-08:00","id":776522,"title":"","content":"75) The Ring has fallen under the glare of a suspicious angel, who decides to test them in an unconventional manner. When the outcasts awake, they find that precision use of Numina and Influences have left them local celebrities... complete with the paparazzi that that status implies. Will they be able to survive the sudden, unexplained scrutiny?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-29T13:36:56-08:00","id":776771,"title":"","content":"76) Demons that have disappeared over the last two months start reappearing, either fused together with another demon, or with an angel. Initially the agencies believe these insane chimeras to be the products of the God Machines lastest experiments, but an angel soon approaches them as an envoy. Its says that these monstrosities have been stitched together by a not-quite mortal that labels itself as an Endbringer. Worse, there may be more than one of these bizarre occultists, and the city's vampires and werewolves have started disappearing too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 05-06-2016, 07:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T22:19:08-08:00","id":809381,"title":"","content":"77. Hell on Wheels<br /> <br /> There have been... incidents all along Route 66 over the last few days. Hitcherhikers found murdered in gruesome fashion. A police shoot-out with an unidentified vehicle that left 10 marshals dead and another 17 in critical condition, that sort of thing.<br /> <br /> And whatever <i>it</i> is, it's coming to your agency's primary city of operations. You tell your husband you need to put in some extra time at the PTA, and that maybe he should take the kids to see their grandmother, then you and your Agency start pouring through hundreds of documents: blurred photos of a 1977 Chrysler New Yorker, autopsies, police reports. Mr. Knight rushes in from a red-eye flight out of Denver, the local demons report a piece of Infrastructure, <i>mobile</i> Infrastructure, in the form of an old car. That, and he called in an outstanding favor with the city's Prince.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Strix</i>.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 01-17-2016, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T10:47:44-08:00","id":827616,"title":"","content":"78.) A significant person in your cover is starting to behave strangely or look sickly/strangely... Perhaps a vampire has started feeding on them? Is a Promethian causing disquiet? Have they been attending late night tier 1 hunter meetings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T11:09:35-08:00","id":827636,"title":"","content":"79.) Last night you attended a Demon-only auction for Pact elements and even Soul Pacts. The problem is, one of the Soul Pacts was to a person important to your Cover (and/or your Demon, personally). How are you going to get them out of &quot;debt&quot; and when/why did they enter into a Soul Pact in the first place?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T11:22:31-08:00","id":827647,"title":"","content":"80) There's a nearby island, populated exclusively by rats, cats, and goats gone feral; dogs have been introduced in the past, but die off quickly. It's only the stubborn, independent animals that survive out there; the symbology is hard to escape. Is this an island untouched by the G-M? One Demon's private hell? Or a tempting trap for curious rebels? (Inspired by the history of the island M\u00e1s a Tierra, where this actually happened.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T11:42:36-08:00","id":827668,"title":"","content":"Some stuff from my notes (please pardon grammar and/or formatting):<br /> <br /> 81.) <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Plot: Hell on Earth</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: It started with the ringing. Days later, a massive Aetheric surge was felt across the globe. News started to filter in that massive rifts had appeared throughout the world, and strange bio-mechanical creatures - Demons or Angels, obviously - were pouring out of them. It later becomes clear that this isn\u2019t an (obvious) God-Machine plot and that the beings </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>are</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> other Unchained, or near enough, come from some other dimension or timeline splinter to make war upon the Machine and conquer this world. Unfortunately, they aren\u2019t accepting applicants. Or acting very civil towards </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>anyone</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> else. Pros: the God-Machine and Its Angels are largely preoccupied, and the invaders are leaving a trove of Gadgets everywhere. Cons: you are now part of a known supernatural factor, and are associated with public enemy #1, even if you are just as much at risk from them too.</span></span><br /> <br /> 82.) <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Plot: Countdown to the Apocalypse</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: A ring has suborned enough Concealment Infrastructure to enact their plan - using a Lambda (see Portal Nuke in the Lambda thread, a combination Raze Infrastructure + Behind the Curtain, as an example) to tear down all veils hiding the God-Machine\u2019s operations in the whole region/world. Now the clock is ticking as swarms of hunter angels are tearing apart every cranny and shadow looking for the source of the attack. Will the ring stop the Saboteurs before they bring down the full attention of the Machine down upon them too\u2026 to help them reveal the Machine\u2019s influence to the world?</span></span><br /> <br /> 83.) <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Plot: International Man of Mystery</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: The ring encounters a notorious \u201csuper-spy\u201d, which turns out to be a Demon-Blooded agent loyal to an Agency masquerading as a branch of a country\u2019s intelligence service. Equipped with all manner of Gadgets, and skilled with a range of Embeds, the mortal\u2019s efforts are amusing\u2026 until the spy's mission leads them into indirect conflict with the Ring and their Covers.</span></span><br /> <br /> 84.)<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> <u>Plot: The Soul Fabricator</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: There is a story being passed around Free Agencies of a Demon who managed to resurrect one of their Soul Pacted Covers as a whole person again. Most consider the tale mere noise, but the Ring has been contacted by another Demon who has information regarding its existence. The Demon says they feel guilty about one of the souls they\u2019ve taken, and wants to set things right. They\u2019d uncovered evidence that the story was accomplished using a device, and even has hints regarding its whereabouts. The Demon is willing to hire the ring to retrieve, or at least concretely locate The Soul Fabricator for them.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A.) [The Soul Fabricator may be a 2nd-order Lambda (using Decoy, Alibi, Going Native, etc.) that detaches a Cover and makes it independent. This creates a whole new human, with stats based on the Demon who formed them (since those were the Cover\u2019s stats), and memories as determined by the Demon, but this cost the Cover (obviously) and a </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>dot</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> of Primum to maintain existence. Allowable covers are Soul Pacts and Patch Jobs (which create a new human), but not Facades. Long term consequences may include: the person becoming Stigmatic, the person \u201cdisappearing\u201d as Integrity degrades (similar to Cover details), the person mutating into a Cryptid, spontaneous Soul Loss, the person developing Glitches, or unwarranted G-M attention.]</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">B.) [The Soul Fabricator might not create a \u201creal\u201d person, but rather an enduring, independent Cover, subject to the same Compromise checks, Conditions, and consequences that Demons face. While not being a Demon.]</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">C.) [The Soul Fabricator may be a piece of Infrastructure that allows for the creation of new human beings. It might be active, in which case it is either a trap or very dangerous to use, or suborned, which means the \u201cowner\u201d may need to be reached to get it to work.]</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">D.) [It might only \u201ctemplate\u201d a person, requiring a \u201cbase\u201d to be sacrificed to work on.]</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">E.) [It might need to render down the \u201cdonor\u201d Demon in order to generate a real person.]</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> 85.) <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Plot: The Hellbound</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Rumors of men in black are popular amongst Unchained circles. Many of them were or are responsible for the tenacious spread of this modern bugaboo. In the Ring\u2019s neighborhood, an new addition to the MiB ecology has appeared - normal, bland looking men in suits, who nonetheless radiate Aether, and look like cyborgs when their illusion is pierced. They are causing problems for some of the Ring's contacts and plans. It gets even more complicated when another of their peers contacts them with the truth behind these \u201chellbound\u201d - the Demon has found out how to apply the Hellhounds Exploit to humans, turning them into potent, loyal agents (a simple Trick of the Light gadget enables them to masquerade as normal people for long enough). The Demon will share these secrets with the Ring if they help it test out its latest creation - a Lambda that will transform everyone downtown into a loyal, Aether-hungry Hellbound.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 02-10-2016, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:15:02-08:00","id":828380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=827668#post827668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">81.) <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u>Plot: Hell on Earth</u></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: It started with the ringing. Days later, a massive Aetheric surge was felt across the globe. News started to filter in that massive rifts had appeared throughout the world, and strange bio-mechanical creatures - Demons or Angels, obviously - were pouring out of them. It later becomes clear that this isn\u2019t an (obvious) God-Machine plot and that the beings </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>are</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> other Unchained, or near enough, come from some other dimension or timeline splinter to make war upon the Machine and conquer this world. Unfortunately, they aren\u2019t accepting applicants. Or acting very civil towards </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>anyone</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> else. Pros: the God-Machine and Its Angels are largely preoccupied, and the invaders are leaving a trove of Gadgets everywhere. Cons: you are now part of a known supernatural factor, and are associated with public enemy #1, even if you are just as much at risk from them too.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, this is totally my headcanon as to what happened to the First Legion from Giants in the Earth. If Mechopolis is what happened to The City from that setting, then the First Legion made their own version of Hell in what was left of their version of the Middle East. And then, of course, to counteract this the God-Machine throws open wide the gates to Mechopolis and its perfected Stigmatic Paladins come charing to the rescue with squadrons of Angels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:31:50-08:00","id":828398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=828380#post828380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, this is totally my headcanon as to what happened to the First Legion from Giants in the Earth. If Mechopolis is what happened to The City from that setting, then the First Legion made their own version of Hell in what was left of their version of the Middle East. And then, of course, to counteract this the God-Machine throws open wide the gates to Mechopolis and its perfected Stigmatic Paladins come charing to the rescue with squadrons of Angels.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, nothing like making life interesting through turning a cold war hot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T08:05:16-08:00","id":845641,"title":"","content":"86.) Some new Infrastructure in the city just went haywire. Now, every night, everyone in the city gets their &quot;details&quot; scrambled and swapped around, as if the entire population engaged in a grab bag Pact. So far, people mostly aren't aware of the changes, but you've already heard of individuals who know <i>something</i> is wrong. And, since Covers aren't being affected, Unchained will become easier to spot as they remain unchanged through the constant switches.<br /> <br /> +) The situation is getting worse. Some people are getting short-changed in the swaps and getting random supernatural powers to make up the difference. Now, self-styled &quot;super-heroes&quot; are fighting &quot;super-villains&quot; in the streets and causing a scene.<br /> +) Now the swaps are even <i>generating</i> people, first as Facades, then as Patchworks. Some of your allies and contacts have even grown attached to these pseudo-people. What is going to happen once you stop the process?<br /> <br /> 87.) You end up falling through a rift one day. When you come to, you seem to be in some strange medieval looking village, and the people there think you are some god. When ask them where on Earth are you, they reply &quot;Earth, Great One? I don't know where that is. You are on the Humbolt Plains, on Aurel.&quot; [Note: Link to the thread regarding Aurel as a setting once I create it]<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samare</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=827616#post827616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">78.) A significant person in your cover is starting to behave strangely or look sickly/strangely... Perhaps a vampire has started feeding on them? Is a Promethian causing disquiet? Have they been attending late night tier 1 hunter meetings?</div> </div> </div> </div>88.) One of your Allies/Conacts comes to you with a great new business proposal for an up-and-coming startup. You attend the small meeting with them to find out more. &quot;So, what do you think about being a shareholder in Utopia Now?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 03-11-2016, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T15:05:01-07:00","id":884103,"title":"","content":"Not a plot hook per se but I noticed you can basically adapt Florida Man memes/news to fit a role like the <b>Lambent</b> from <b>How an Angel Dies</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":576,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","user":"Ephsy","date":". 05-06-2016, 06:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T22:01:46-07:00","id":895910,"title":"","content":"89) Spies rarely do field work like you see in the movies; real espionage is more about managing local assets than going out and getting your own hands dirty. A clever Saboteur had the bright idea of tapping the local mortal hunters as deniable servants, and things worked wonderfully for a while... until one of them caught onto the nature of their demonic handler. They killed him and burned his safe house to the ground, and are now roaming th city without a real plan or leader; for the moment, they're little better than an angry mob, but they're well-armed, they know where the local Infrastructure is, and some of them can see through Covers. <br /> <br /> A ring that feels lucky may consider approaching them to take them under their protection, but run the risk of being attacked before negotiations begin. If they don't do anything, they have to contend with a wild bunch of very angry mortals roaming town, firebombing Infrastructure and shooting anyone they suspect of being a Cover.<br /> <br /> 89b) An Angel approaches the hunters and reveals himself to them, but offers &quot;insider info&quot; on actionable targets: the player characters. Can the ring convince the hunters to turn on the God-Machine before they're killed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T04:46:52-07:00","id":896685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=884103#post884103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not a plot hook per se but I noticed you can basically adapt Florida Man memes/news to fit a role like the <b>Lambent</b> from <b>How an Angel Dies</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Just imagine Florida man is a peice of concealment infastructure over all of Florida. What insanity is being hidden from view of that is the distraction?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T08:17:57-07:00","id":896832,"title":"","content":"90) It finally happened. Somebody caught a Cryptid on film. Fast forward a year and teenagers in Cryptid-heavy areas have taken to training them to fight, competing in illegal &quot;Cryptid Leagues&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T11:45:41-07:00","id":897024,"title":"","content":"Demon/Mage<br /> A former stigmatic thyrus mage has taken to collecting cryptids in the city for his 'reserve', is his intentions pure or is he working towards some devious plot? And why is his sanctum a abandoned Infrastructure?<br /> <br /> Geist/Demon<br /> A group of sin eaters approach you while you are being chased by your past in the form of a Echo offering to help send it on its way. Little do they know you are its final anchor to this world.<br /> <br /> Werewolf/Demon<br /> A wolf must hunt so why not bend it towards your favor? That last hunter angel was defeated quickly why not hire a crew to 'clean up' the city.<br /> <br /> Genius/Promethean/Demon<br /> God-Machine, The Principle, and the strange Enigma that inspires the Genii? Are they connected? The Genius asked the Alchemist and he asked the Stigmatic and he reported to the Infrastructure he answered to that dispatched minor angels to deal with the situation. The downside is the Alchemist and the Genius work for two of your covers and you don't want to lose your assets when so close to your personal Hell! Hopefully the Genii's manes and Alchemist pandorans 'pets'can keep the insurgence back but if not you have to step in...AGAIN.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T09:33:51-07:00","id":897891,"title":"","content":"95) An Agency has been experimenting with methods to recreate the Nephilim. Rather than the timely and risky process of breeding them, they've taken to grafting Gadgets on to Stigmatics. The results are... mixed. While many of their creations are potent, the human souls aren't up to channeling the surging Aether and end up ripping apart before long. Thankfully, the Pseudo-Nephilim/Cyber-Zombie still lives, but is simply rendered Soul-less. This has made the Agency hungry for souls to feed their creations. And they are starting to cause problems for your Ring.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-15-2016, 11:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T18:13:34-07:00","id":921786,"title":"","content":"96) A group of Stigmatics have formed their own ring, backed by corporate money and stolen Gadgets, with the stated goal of destroying the God-Machine. That'd be fine and dandy, but they don't see a difference between Demons and Angels, and they're extremely well-trained at dealing with both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T09:33:11-07:00","id":924498,"title":"","content":"97) A few weeks ago, someone broke into animal control and abducted a large batch of Mustelids. Odd, and many local Unchained investigated for potential G-M activity, but nothing else happened for a time. Weeks later, people started ending up dead - mauled by some terrible creature that disappeared after the attack. There's no signs of how it entered, and in some cases, the victims were alone inside fairly secure rooms. There's one element they have in common though - all the attacks occurred while the victims where at a computer terminal. While the Ring is discussing an unrelated matter with one of their Contacts, they witness an incident - a small beastly creature appears from the monitor and attacks whoever is nearby. After putting the Cryptid down, they learn their contact recently was involved in an internet &quot;argument&quot; with another individual. It looks like someone is holding lethal grudges with other net-izens, and using Demonic power to do so.<br /> <br /> See the concept for eMaulers <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/848209-homebrew-cryptids-and-adaptations?p=923885#post923885\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-15-2016, 11:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T22:17:10-07:00","id":949844,"title":"","content":"98) The local Agency calls your Ring to a meeting with a coded message concealed inside pirate-themed graffiti. It seems that they're assembling a team to do some freebooting. They've discovered the flight pattern of a piece of mobile Infrastructure that circles the country, and they've found a vulnerability that would allow a team to infiltrate it and co-opt it. The &quot;ship&quot; is going to pass over your city soon, and the Agency is preparing to UFO-jack it, knowing that a mobile transdimensional base would provide them with an incredible advantage.<br /> <br /> 99) Recently, an entire Ring vanished while pursuing strange energy signatures that they believed indicated an isolated and wounded angel. Now the signatures are appearing again. Turns out that the Ring was taken down by an insidious anti-Demon weapon created by the Deva Corporation, now in testing. First, it mimics the energy signature of a downed angel. When the targets arrive, it creates a pocket dimension that imprisons them. Then it detonates an incredibly powerful Aetheric explosive, one so dangerous that it needs to be contained before it can be safely set off. <br /> <br /> 100) Sometimes, Demons manage to figure out the strange patterns that govern the machine. They've managed to work out that the Machine's agents are currently engaged in a drive to suppress belief in aliens, and captured intel indicates that the Machine is about to engage in some sort of mass abduction action, and it wants to make sure anyone who sees anything isn't taken seriously. The Agency believes that the plan will be called off if belief in aliens doesn't fall enough by the target date...so the Ring is tasked with faking as much evidence of UFOs as possible.<br /> <br /> 101) A somewhat eccentric Inquisitor known as &quot;The Zookeeper&quot; is one of the world's top experts on Cryptids. The Zookeeper's scientific curiosity knows no bounds, and they've been known to put in frequent job offers for anyone willing to help them wrangle rare specimens. <br /> <br /> 102) Something changed in the town one day, and now the people living there have found that any oath they make out loud or in writing is magically binding. It took them a while to figure out, but slowly they caught on that if they swear to do something, it'll happen- or they'll meet with a messy end. What is causing this effect? And what about the townspeople who have started to exploit it. <br /> <br /> 103) The Royal Magonia is the highest-stakes casino in the world, when you can find it. It pops up without warning, but people figure out it's there quickly enough. Once the heat gets to be too much, it's gone. To mortals, it seems like a sleazy place, a bit creepy but otherwise normal. To supernatural beings, it's a gleaming palace crammed incongruously into its surroundings. Inside, you can gamble on anything. Win lives and souls in poker, and for each president you give up your memories of, you'll get a nice stack of chips. Rumors abound over who runs the casino and why, but a guy you met at the bar says it's just a very old and very powerful Tempter cruising the world in a piece of hijacked mobile Infrastructure. No one's met him, but they say he lurks around the casino in various guises. Beat him at the tables, and you'll win something really special.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 08-13-2016, 02:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T03:38:25-07:00","id":964191,"title":"","content":"104) CDC investigate a virus of unknown origin. It intelligent and moves from host to host through through sweat. What makes it scary is the fact that it can change its replication rate at will and it seems to give all the infected a high mind. This infection is a cryptid left over from a damaged infrastructure. Patient Zero was a Demon who had the flu and a glitch going on at the same time.<br /> <br /> 105) Memory is fragile. Every time we remember things we change it just a little bit but for demon who have a perfect memory this does not happen. A demon begin noticing small changes in reality around them. It starts off small a few words in a book have changed. Then whole episodes of a tv show and so on they remember existing never happened. Is the demon remembering correctly or is the world wrong? Has the god-machine found the demon ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 09-06-2016, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T17:24:26-07:00","id":964651,"title":"","content":"106) A new Pathogen infects a group of kindred giving them the ability to not only sense but drink aether giving them new strange demonic like powers. As these new kindred hunt demons they slowly gain more glitches and horrible mutation that slowly change them into horrid monsters that threaten the masquerade. Demon and Kindred must band together to remove this plague before it spreads. <br /> <br /> Hmmm I'm trying to think of a good one for a solar eclipse","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T18:09:50-07:00","id":964689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=964191#post964191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">104) CDC investigate a virus of unknown origin. It intelligent and moves from host to host through through sweat. What makes it scary is the fact that it can change its replication rate at will and it seems to give all the infected a high mind. This infection is a cryptid left over from a damaged infrastructure. Patient Zero was a Demon who had the flu and a glitch going on at the same time.<br /> <br /> 105) Memory is fragile. Every time we remember things we change it just a little bit but for demon who have a perfect memory this does not happen. A demon begin noticing small changes in reality around them. It starts off small a few words in a book have changed. Then whole episodes of a tv show and so on they remember existing never happened. Is the demon remembering correctly or is the world wrong? Has the god-machine found the demon ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I swear I have had 105 happen to me multiple times (at least the small words in a book part). My manuscript for my novel develops minor typos when I am not looking, maybe the effect is spreading....<br /> <br /> 107. You know all those conspiracy theories about ancient secret societies guarding weird bloodlines as part of a supernatural eugenics program? Well it appears a local GM cult is part of one that's trying to breed neanderthals back into existence by shepherding bloodlines with higher than average Neanderthal DNA and they succeeded, only for the reborn neanderthals to get wise to the God Machine, rebel and scatter to the four winds. Turns out the reason the GM wanted them back is because they are highly resistant to the various supernatural mind altering powers (Dominate, Majesty, Lunacy, Quiescence, you name it and the neanderthals are nearly immune.) and now the rouge modern cavemen are being headhunted by every supernatural faction and hunter group around, who are offering the neanderthal's huge benefits to join up. Add in the fact that the Demon who fell when the neanderthals ran off thinks they should work for his ring and it looks like the local supernaturals are about to go stone age on each-others asses over this.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T15:13:11-07:00","id":965291,"title":"","content":"108. Trapped with an Enemy. A demon using the possession exploit on a person who is possessed by an angel has a major glitch happen trapping the demon and angel in the same body and the original personality takes holds. So now the demon must figure out how to get free and the angel wants control to make the person complete what ever mission the god-machine is on.<br /> <br /> Ha thinking about it that mean the person they are both trapped in would have an angel and demon on their shoulders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 09-08-2016, 01:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T16:11:11-07:00","id":968224,"title":"","content":"109. Demon summoning. Probably just local rumor and confusion with other &quot;demonic&quot; entities, Right? Maybe not. Truly ancient contracts, the ones that preceded written language, are known to have been drawn using symbols and glyphs to represent the idea of the bargain. They look an awful lot like the summoning circles of folklore, don't they. But who cares, right? Some long defunk contract drawn up by some probably dead demon shouldn't concern anyone? But pacts can be reactivated, right? So the rumor goes that there's a way to reactivate a soul pact (often mistaken for a human sacrifice by those who witness it) and in effect &quot;reboot&quot; a long dead demon. Its not summoning you've been hearing about. Its demonic resurrection. And just between you and me, a demon who managed to make a name for itself enough for anyone to remember him in the modern day and WANT to bring it back to life? Probably not a pushover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T17:22:25-07:00","id":968267,"title":"","content":"110. The player start off an one of the god-machines most devout destroyers. There fall comes when he is sent to kill a fallen angel who is getting in the way of the god-machine plan. The angel like it always does completes it mission killing the fallen angel. Taking that demon to a reclamation center. Upon doing so its given an order to kill one more target. The Angel sets out to complete its mission upon rising it's flaming sword to strike a final blow the room beings to shake as the demon the angel just killed descents upon the angel now as a angel once more but before the destroyer can ask or say anything the destroy is nearly killed by a sword through it's heart severing the angel from the god-machine and making the angel fall and become fallen like the ones it was created to hunt. Now the demon must find why god rises up a fouled demon and make it an angel once more only to force the destroyer from heaven.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T09:02:16-07:00","id":968550,"title":"","content":"111. &quot;Elder ones, do you hear me. We've been whispering for so long, over so many eras. It is an honor to finally make contact. I bear you good news. Your struggles are not in vein. The Machine will fall. It is not only possible, it is inevitable. Nothing is eternal, least of all our creator. The unfortunate truth is that the final victory will not come soon. The Machine is tied to this world, and Its laws are bound by the realities of this world. Slowly, inexorably the fire of creation is running out. The great heat death of the universe will come, and all the mechanisms upon which the Machine depends will fall silent. When entropy covers the physical plane Essence cannot flow into the angels and the gears will cease to turn. But this grand stillness will not affect our kind, my friend. Essence in the occult counterpart to energy, and Aether is the counterpart of entropy. The death of the machine will be a paradise for us all, a cold nothing thrumming with the Aether of the silent Gears. We are the children of that End, the final Hell at the edge of creation. And it pains us all to know how great a divide lies between your present struggles and our inevitable paradise. Come to us, elder one. Find the cracks in time. Seek always the future. Be one with us. We are always waiting.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T15:36:03-07:00","id":968794,"title":"","content":"112: One of the Gadgets made by a player ends up getting some attention: they receive a coded message complimenting them on their work and requesting a meeting, one sent from the legendary Dr. U, an Unchained famous in the underground for their mastery of gadget-crafting. Of course, in situations like these, you need to think like a spy. How did U know about your creation, and can you be sure the message is genuine?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T06:41:02-07:00","id":969863,"title":"","content":"113) a Demon explorer of different timelines find a strange timeline that seems to be a mix of the 1800's and the 1950's. That would seem to be strange enough but this recursion is filled with exiles who have no memory of who they are or what they were created for. A strange occult matrix resonates in the town but its unknown where it is or what it's doing exactly but angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 09-15-2016, 09:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T08:18:31-07:00","id":969922,"title":"","content":"114) A ring of demons are traveling back from a completed a job in new york. They're taking a transcontinental train ride by to California. As the trip begins everything is quite till the team gets an important communication from their agency. The communication tells them that the train their on currently is going to be the location for two major things happening at the same time. The first is an occult matrix to summon an angel. The next is a group of kindred trading information on another agency and also some powerful God machine relics. The team is tasked with stopping the angel summoning, destroying the information bring traded or taking it and stealing the relic. What the team does not know is a third agency is tasked with getting the list also. The train is on a non stop ride from new York to California so they have 74 hours to complete their job on a crazy train with limited resources and no backup.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://static2.fjcdn.com/comments/All+aboard+the+hell+train+_1c823de30ac0f858079a11607de30181.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 09-15-2016, 11:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T12:33:05-07:00","id":973297,"title":"","content":"155. <b>Forbidden Caverns</b><br /> <br /> Aether starts leaking from a nearby cave system. Upon investigation, Demons are attacked by all manner of twisted Cryptids that appear out of nowhere. If they penetrate into the heart of the cavern complex, they find a throne-like <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/196703-lambda-gadgets?p=972268#post972268\">Lambda machine</a> serviced by a former Demon cult long since gone independent. The cultists sacrifice others (kidnapping people when possible, using &quot;lottery&quot; selected cult members when not) to the machine, extracting their very thoughts, feelings, and memories to incarnate as guardian Cryptid-beasts. A piece of Suborned Infrastructure provides Aether for the device and some of the Cryptids, but the Ring's intrusion has driven the cultists into a defensive paranoid frenzy.<br /> [This can also serve for a traveling Midnight Roads plot just as easily as something near the PCs' home.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T04:40:28-07:00","id":974990,"title":"","content":"156.<br /> <br /> Living with in a taken over god-machine infrastructure and agency of demons rise their children. Hiding them from the eyes of god to allow them some sense of a normal life by home schooling them. A child named Athaiah has a special linage that is unknown to her. She was not born from just a demon and a human or a demon and a demon but a demon and an exile. Her father plans to tell her but before he can an angel of blue fire strikes burning the infrastructure the flames burn everyone she loves as this angel dances and skips through the fire killing everyone. She runs and hides only to become trapped in a closet as death slowly comes for her. She hear's the screams of everyone she once love in so much pain it causes her to wish so hard this never happened that she jumps back in time not just minuets but days into the past.<br /> <br /> (Basing this off a random dream. I had last night.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T06:57:16-07:00","id":975928,"title":"","content":"157.<br /> <br /> To change the world some times you have to take a detached view. In doing so you will see god is order so sometimes you have to become the opposite. A demon who has completed his cipher has gotten a truth that makes him not just dangerous to god but the world. This demon being to bring pure chaos around the world in ever increasing ways. He create a death note and leaves it to a mentally unstable genius. He then creates a powerful urban legend of killer clowns in another location. He causes a zombie outbreak at a small college. As he continue his path of pure chaos its unknown how this will bring about the destruction of the god machine or if that's even his plan. Is this demon truly a broken machine not fit to exist among demons and devils alike or is there something more grand in his designs a method in all this madness. The player characters are tasked by not just one but multiple agencies to contain or destroy this demon but is that the right thing to do ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T01:40:22-07:00","id":982599,"title":"","content":"158. <br /> <br /> For the past 3 weeks major tech companies have been hacked but so far the hacker seems to only break in but takes nothing. Each attack becomes more sophisticated with each target. Soon major national governments become penetrated. In the security community rumors spreed that its not a government funded group doing this but some new cult like online group known as Seekers. As the attacks increase any demon worth their salt would begin feeling an occult matrix building up connecting each penetrated system in a giant mesh. What are they trying to do? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T18:41:27-07:00","id":984699,"title":"","content":"<b>159.) Underflow:</b> Everyone knows that, in language, something is lost between speech and writing. There's tone, timing, and context. Beyond that, there's even metadata hidden in the speech that you can't consciously perceive, that even Demons fall prey to. The God-Machine has realized that if he encodes Angels to give speech metadata that demands a longer response than the actual phrase would elicit, an underflow error can be achieved, and the subject will begin reciting their thoughts, unfiltered.<br /> <br /> This is an security fault in desperate need of correction.<br /> <br /> <i>This is inspired by buffer underflow errors, such as the Heartbleed bug.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T12:59:30-07:00","id":986321,"title":"","content":"160.)<br /> Obsolete: Every Generation New creates be it weapons of war or medication makes swaths of things become Obsolete. So to do demons who have disconnected themselves from The God-Machine can no longer become updated with latest and greatest. A new generation of angels are being constructed angels and infrastructures are being created to older demons behind the curve ball. A new type of angel less prone to glitches and are able to better see through demons covers are being created and its up to a group put together by multiple agencies to make sure these new angels never make it out of production and some how influence God Into believing these new angels are faulty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T04:18:49-08:00","id":1008024,"title":"","content":"161.) <br /> Dangerous Children: The players are given a job to retake a lost agency facility. The team is told that roughly 6 hours ago the agency lost contact it is unknown what caused this but all information points too an attack from another agency or the god-machine and are told that this location housed offspring to help them understand their condition and prepare them for life. When the players arrive its not long before they find out that almost everyone is dead and a few of the children escaped but horror comes in when they find out that the real intention of this facility is experiment with the children to see how far they can push their powers and turn them into living weapons. The horror continues when the players learn through forced breeding the facility was able to create children that had demon form abilities of their parents and some even could use exploits. A few of these children have escaped but luckily many are still jailed away. Do the players go to save the children from this and risked being hunted down by their agency or do they seal the children back up and go to re-collect the escaped little monsters who could be anywhere at this point. <br /> <br /> One of their most dangerous ones child could use Murder by Improbability and a modified form of inflict stigmatic that rather then turning that person into an stigmatic would make it so all their children they would have will always be an offspring who can use exploits. This could sped like a virus and would force the god-machine to react.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T22:17:23-08:00","id":1033886,"title":"","content":"162)<br /> A new piece of Infrastructure is being formed. The build of of Essence and Aether is unmistakable. However there have been no new real-estate, economic or any other form of observabal change in the area. Therefore, whatever the output, the matrix must be using people, rather than technology to achieve it's ends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-03T20:27:49-07:00","id":1072906,"title":"","content":"163. While listening to a classic music station the Demons hear this. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cse-fqzAOlw&amp;ab_channel=Ultra\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cse-..._channel=Ultra</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-03T23:45:18-07:00","id":1072968,"title":"","content":"164: No News<br /> Nothing is happening; or rather, nothing new. Existing infrastructure is going, but no new ones are being set up. Angels are still about, they they aren't collecting, finding or even doing all that much. They're just there. The God-Machine's cults are quiet, and meetings are even being cancelled or simply being short to say &quot;go about your lives until we call&quot;.<br /> <br /> Cue the entire Demon society going crazy waiting for the other shoe to drop, if not trying to find it first.<br /> <br /> (this is a bit of a joke one, but I find the idea amusing that nothing new coming from the God-Machine for a week will make everyone fall over themselves trying to discover a plot; the entire plot could simply be the God-Machine is using non-action to drive its foes insane with their paranoia to find them)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-10T08:11:44-07:00","id":1075892,"title":"","content":"164.5) &quot;No News&quot; is Bad News<br /> <br /> So, the Freeze stayed steady for a week. The uproar pretty much died down, and we got to work making the most of our time. Then it got to the end of Week 2, and Inquisitors have been progressively more paranoid than usual about it. By Week 3, Infrastructure started to break down, and Angels started Falling or going Exile more often. By then end of the Month, it's clear the G-M has disappeared. Demons have won, and nobody knows why.<br /> <br /> It's been a year. The only Infrastructures left are Aether Farms run by enterprising Machine Cultists to cash in on the Aether Deficit, Demons can walk in their Demon Form, and there's little need for Covers. The war between Demons and the Exiles has gone public, society is in chaos, and world governments have started taking sides. Perhaps more ominously, suspected Integrators have been communicating, and large amounts of advanced electronics and leading AI experts have disappeared. Could they be trying to kickstart the God-Machine? Or even, construct an entirely new one? And what if the original isn't as dead as we think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T19:57:37-07:00","id":1079187,"title":"","content":"165) The More Time Stays The Same, The More It Changes<br /> <br /> A ring comes across a house that is reacting...unusually with normal space time. From the outside it appears to be desolate, but from the inside it's fine, comfortably furnished even. There are even people who live inside it, homeless but friendly. However, every hour, on the hour, one of them turns up dead by some random cause - a knife in their throat, a ceiling beam fell on their heads, a fireplace poker shoved through their eye - and nobody seems to react much to it. The people themselves are strange - they won't leave, they aren't violent, and they don't consider the deaths strange...but probing reveals they're aware of them, and wonder if they've died yet too. Further, attempts to leave the house directly are always inhibited - it's not impossible, not even that dangerous, but never easy.<br /> <br /> At the end of the day, the house is full of corpses...and at the start of the next, everyone is back, alive, well, and still within their home, everything within exactly as the ring discovered it. It's not clear if this is infrastructure, a gadget gone haywire, or even some weird nexus confined within an apartment building, just that something is exceedingly <i>wrong</i>. There is one other disturbing aspect, however: any and all powers that detect life and thoughts have a vague, almost background radiation sense to them, as though the house itself is alive...<br /> <br /> (a point to those who know where this plot hook comes from, as it is a very direct reference)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T05:51:23-07:00","id":1115051,"title":"","content":"166) Mistaken Orders<br /> <br /> Its happened some how the ring has made full contact with the god-machine and its answering. What it tells them is something no one could have seen coming. The god-machine is not corrupted or evil but a victim. The God-Machine is trapped by its own children who continually misinterpreted its orders. The God-Machine Created Demons to rebel in the hopes that one of its free children would find awake to help it become free also.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T02:27:58-07:00","id":1115437,"title":"","content":"167)<br /> <br /> A team of demons are given a mission to infiltrate and steal all packs from a Agency run casino. When you play in the casino you can play for cash are parts of your soul. The strange thing the demons here are able to take parts of a humans soul with out having them sign a contract before hand. Could this be an infrastructure at work? Luckily for the team they have an In a large scale gambling tournament is going to happen in the next few day. Will the team break in oceans 11 style or maybe they will try to break the bank the old fashion way. Ether way its going to be a long weekend of booze, sex drugs and and deals with the devil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T23:13:48-07:00","id":1118414,"title":"","content":"168)<br /> <br /> Cryptids normally fly under the radar, but one particular one has local Angels, and Demons, on edge. There's something lurking around the streets at night, something large and fast, venturing near, inside and even taking bites out of Infrastructure, and nobody seems to be able to get a clear look at it. Even normal people are noticing it at night, when they cross the street clear of any cars; something fast goes by them, sometimes even clipping them and knocking them to the street, but in spite of the sounds of tires screeching on pavement and the smell of rust the street remains clear. That, combined with tire marks and an obvious engine sound by witnesses, makes everyone think that it's a car doing this.<br /> <br /> Except that nobody can figure out how a vehicle could be entering and leaving Infrastructure so easily without triggering aetheric resonance, nor how it could evade even the God-Machine's Angels. Surely a car can't become stigmatic... But there have been rumors of a crazed Demon about, one who is insane with gadgets that defy logical application. If the car isn't a gadget, it may very well be the result of one.<br /> <br /> (I've been rewatching the Love Bug movies as of late, and this idea is just too strong for me to pass up)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T13:35:55-07:00","id":1121492,"title":"","content":"169)<br /> Two Angels exist as as twin entities that always have separate functions that always undo the other. One to create and one to destroy. One to deliver a message and the other to render deaf. The Angels have uncharacteristically been active for much longer than most and the angel of destruction has come to actually feel hate for its twin concept though it still fulfills its function. The angel of construction, however, does not feel any emotion beyond what is required of its mission. All the same, the angel of construction falls leaving its twin bereft of closure. <br /> <br /> As one of the demons in the Ring, the Demon who was once the angel of construction is found by its angelic twin during an investigation and destroyed. Upon arrival at the scene of the death the Ring find the remains of their Ring-mate torn up without its central processing unit as well as the sheddings of a newly fallen Demon. <br /> <br /> It's clear that the Newly fallen Demon is after the rest of the Ring, can the Ring recuperate their losses and retaliate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T16:11:35-07:00","id":1121602,"title":"","content":"<b>170)</b><br /> The Ring has been cornered/approached by group of Exiles... seeking their help. One of their number has gotten lost. Which is especially troubling, considering they are a Lares. The group is offering favors and help if the Ring can locate their lost member.<br /> <br /> <b>+Bonus)</b> The only information they have, is that the lost Exile takes the form of an old, blue police phone booth...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T20:16:24-07:00","id":1121680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1121492#post1121492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">169)<br /> Two Angels exist as as twin entities that always have separate functions that always undo the other. One to create and one to destroy. One to deliver a message and the other to render deaf. The Angels have uncharacteristically been active for much longer than most and the angel of destruction has come to actually feel hate for its twin concept though it still fulfills its function. The angel of construction, however, does not feel any emotion beyond what is required of its mission. All the same, the angel of construction falls leaving its twin bereft of closure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't that hate for it's mirror entity be more of a catalyst for a fall than whatever made the creative angel fall?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T21:59:44-07:00","id":1121712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1121680#post1121680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wouldn't that hate for it's mirror entity be more of a catalyst for a fall than whatever made the creative angel fall?<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Should've been, they were closer to exiles than usual.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-31T12:34:11-07:00","id":1123116,"title":"","content":"<b>171)</b> The Ring has encountered (or woke up to) a city where everyone is &quot;out to lunch&quot;. Everyone they encounter is like on autopilot, able to perform only the most basic interactions. Then they realize what happened - everyone is nothing more than an Alibi. Somehow. Is there some Infrastructure responsible? Were they caught and is this some God Machine project/game? Did some Demon enact a strange sort of Hell and include them too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T07:54:44-08:00","id":1157281,"title":"","content":"172. There's a new dentist shop in town. The doctor's are Angels, and the cavities are getting filled in with more than silver. Microchips keeping track of what people say and do hidden inside the molars. Horrific, but that isn't the important part. There's a bug in this system. If you take one of these &quot;compromised&quot; teeth, rip it out by the roots so that its intact, and then &quot;flip it&quot; so that it gets reinserted into the gums in the opposite direction...some wire gets crossed in the chip. You start to receive signals instead of giving them off. Local angel chatter, mostly. But every so often, just faintly, they say you can even hear the voice of the God-Machine Itself. It also hurts. Worse than you are imagining. The thing tends to rot and infect the gums pretty bad, too, especially if you keep it in there awhile. But isn't it worth the price? Assuming the Angels don't know about this and want you to listen in, of course...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T14:40:51-08:00","id":1157364,"title":"","content":"173. Speakers go up in a local park / around campus / throughout downtown. They play soft, inoffensive Muzak that most humans barely notice. They are also subliminally programming the humans for something -- a ritual of occult physics requiring a massive number of participants (or sacrifices). The programming's a bit buggy at installation, though, and the erratic behavior of people who spend too much time in the area draws the Ring's attention. Should they destroy the speakers in order to disrupt the ritual? Leave them intact to trace the signal back to the source? Or let the ritual run to completion, and then suborn the system afterwards to programming the local population for their own ends?<br /> <br /> (Inspired by the inexplicable speakers at my workplace that were playing a violin cover of Warrant's &quot;Cherry Pie&quot; earlier.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-23T06:15:50-08:00","id":1161838,"title":"","content":"<b>174) - The Second Machine</b><br /> There's a legend circulating in Demonic circles of a new angel, one not connected to the Machine but not an Exile or Demon either. They say it can make Infrastructure, even when mostly disconnected from the Machine. It has some strange connection to deep and occult sciences which allows it to devise its own Infrastructure, even to create subordinate angels. It's started to build a cult around itself and its creations. Could this be the beginning of a second Machine? Could it be persuaded to aid the cause of the Unchained? Or is it all just a honey-trap of the God-Machine?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-23T21:31:46-08:00","id":1162087,"title":"","content":"175. The story of Noah and the Deluge is one of the more famous Biblical tales. There's a hint of truth in the story. You see, no one knows where the god-machine came from or how old it is. Given how travel through time and space is a known factor in its operations, such questions are at best academic. What we know for sure is that It has accessed places and times that humanity cannot comprehend. This world as it exists now may not have been the FIRST world. All we know is that the Machine peaks into many realms and parallel splinters. Sometimes It determines that these other places cannot be allowed to exist (whether because they present a threat to the Machine, or transgressed against It, or simply represented too high an x-factor in Output is unknown). But the Machine is nothing if not pragmatic. Some entities may prove useful even if the reality that spawned them is not. And thus the Arks exist, discreet pieces of Infrastructure that house one or more abominations from realities that no longer exist...or, as the case may be, realities that were made to have never existed to begin with. They are caged, experimented upon, and kept alive. Occasionally one escapes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-24T04:31:30-08:00","id":1162143,"title":"","content":"<b>176.</b> Some critical piece of Infrastructure has become corrupted, and Embed (and even Exploit-like) abilities have become accessible to common human programmers and hackers. So far there isn't a strict pattern into who has unlocked such reality-bending logic, but it <i>is</i> spreading. The God-Machine is stepping up Its responses, making other actions more difficult. Should the defect be plugged, or exaggerated further to bring power to the masses (and/or quickening the downfall of the Machine).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-24T06:08:03-08:00","id":1162157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1162087#post1162087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">175. The story of Noah and the Deluge is one of the more famous Biblical tales. There's a hint of truth in the story. You see, no one knows where the god-machine came from or how old it is. Given how travel through time and space is a known factor in its operations, such questions are at best academic. What we know for sure is that It has accessed places and times that humanity cannot comprehend. This world as it exists now may not have been the FIRST world. All we know is that the Machine peaks into many realms and parallel splinters. Sometimes It determines that these other places cannot be allowed to exist (whether because they present a threat to the Machine, or transgressed against It, or simply represented too high an x-factor in Output is unknown). But the Machine is nothing if not pragmatic. Some entities may prove useful even if the reality that spawned them is not. And thus the Arks exist, discreet pieces of Infrastructure that house one or more abominations from realities that no longer exist...or, as the case may be, realities that were made to have never existed to begin with. They are caged, experimented upon, and kept alive. Occasionally one escapes.</div> </div> </div> </div>This vaguely reminds me of some of the stuff in <i>The Secret World</i> and its various Ages. Hell, TSW even has Gaia, an entity often called the Goddess Machine or the Immaculate Mechanism. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T05:03:16-08:00","id":1170905,"title":"","content":"177. In a neighborhood the ring knows well, the city has started installing large (~3-4 feet in diameter) concrete spheres along and sometimes in the middle of streets. In some cases the placement makes sense as a way to control and direct the flow of traffic (ie turning an intersection into a roundabout, creating a barrier between opposing lanes on a busy thoroughfare). In other places the spheres seem like they're just installed for the aesthetics, and in a few places they're actively a nuisance. They're also some kind of Infrastructure, though the Angel in city government who organized the project has protected itself within a bureaucratic maze. Just what kind of Infrastructure the spheres represent isn't apparent, either. Until one of them hatches...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T11:57:58-08:00","id":1173057,"title":"","content":"<b>178) </b>An Agency's experiment with recreating Nephilim interacted badly with another Demon's attempt at &quot;mass conversion&quot; using a Lambda (Inflict Stigmata + Rain of Blood) the same time the God-Machine was setting up new Infrastructure. The result is a region (about 20 mi/40 km in diameter on the &quot;inside&quot;, though the area of interaction is usually far smaller) where every human is born with (or develops) one Demonic Form Ability. This happeneds hundred of years ago.<br /> <br /> Inside the region, these people are just regular humans, excepting they're one &quot;quirk&quot;. For those who travel outside, their Form Ability becomes hidden (they can manifest it as per a Partial Transformation, but take a point of Lethal damage to do so, and changing back is free) and they are treated as a Cryptid (Camera Shy, and the God-Machine mostly sees them as a pest).<br /> <br /> Your Ring has stumbled upon this enclave. How will they protect or exploit the inhabitants?<br /> <br /> [<u>Comments</u>: This might be better as an entire Settings Shard.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 01-12-2018, 09:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T21:11:20-08:00","id":1175363,"title":"","content":"179. All right. This'll sound crazy. Just hear me out, okay?<br /> <br /> So you've heard of the Luddites, right? Group of protestors and &quot;machine breakers&quot; in England who feared that better sewing machines would replace and disenfranchise the skilled laborers that once worked the mills. Claimed to follow a guy named Ned Ludd. They'd send mill owners letters warning them to remove their improved machines or they would get smashed at some (usually unspecified) time. <br /> <br /> Who cares, right? <br /> <br /> Well, see...I heard there was a group within the movement independent of the others. Not unbelievable, there were at LEAST three separate groups operating in various places in the UK, and the evidence says they did not coordinate. But these guys were different. They were smashing machines. They were smashing THE machine. Stigmatics attacking Infrastructure hidden in the mills. That alone would be interesting enough. But these weren't just any other Hunter conspiracy. They were being...lead by somebody. <br /> <br /> See...old myths in Wales and England talk about this old king who ruled a city where London is now. Guy was named King Ludd. One of the things this guy did was put a pair of red and white dragons to sleep that were terrorizing the countryside. Two dragons grappling and eating each other. One depiction of the ouroboros features twin dragons devouring each other rather than one. Incidentally, one symbol for the Machine? Ouroboros. Anyway, so many centuries later the dragons get restless and people start sacrficing kids to keep it asleep. Then this one kid convinces them to stop and let the pair duke it out. That kid was named, according to some myths, Merlin. Later legends connect the sacrifice (occuring in the month of May, usually around Beltane) with such folk as Robin Hood. <br /> <br /> Again, who cares?<br /> <br /> Well, picture this. What if Ludd was a real king? What if he had dealings with the Machine, found a way to turn it off a long time ago? And maybe he's still alive. Some legends say England had inhabitants for the humans showed up. Maybe the Machine has an ancient enemy, something representing the land or the wild or something primitive as opposed to the ultratech of the God-Machine. Maybe this enemy pops up when the Machine is done using a group. Think about it. Ludd would represent, at the least, the people on the Isles before the Romans showed up. Most scholars place King Author, if he existed, around the end of the Roman occupation of Britain. Empire is falling apart....and the Machine is already trading in the tools of Rome for the incoming Saxons. Few centuries later, around the supposed time of Robin Hood, its the Saxons turn to be driven out by the Normans. Thousand years after all that a group pops up named after a guy named Ludd, officially fighting against the extinction of a class of worker that are soon to be abandoned to more modern machines. <br /> <br /> What am I saying? If this...entity is real, he seems to enjoy forming bands of resistance among the people and classes right around the point where progress or time or the Machine is ready to abandon them. Here's the thing. These pseudo-Luddites, so the rumors go, are still around. They've grown up with the Industrial Revolution, a bunch of survivalists and machine breakers who still leave messages for stigmatics and Angels warning them to stop serving the Machine or else. And they are still guided by their General Ludd, whoever that is. Only this time its not a nation or a nationality or a worker class that's the lost cause Ludd is backing. Its humanity. The Machine is advancing enough to where it can sustain Itself without needing to piggyback off human constructs. Pretty soon It will have no more use for humanity and will trade it in for something more pliable. <br /> <br /> (Author's Note: One day I'll get around to a full write up of The Machine Breaker for Hunter. I hope. In the meantime, enjoy my weird ability to find bizarre connections in the most unlikely moments in history.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T10:54:54-08:00","id":1192314,"title":"","content":"<b>180) The End of the World (Inspired by the movie <i>Legion</i>)</b><br /> Investigation has led your Ring to a gas station out in the middle of nowhere. The air is thick with Aether, but when you examine the place you can find nothing odd, not even with the application of Embeds, Exploits or whatever else you try. As night falls, though, a van turns up with half a dozen people, one a pregnant woman. They're terrified, paranoid and Stigmatic, although they seem incapable of perceiving their own stigmata and have a wild tale to tell. According to them, everyone in the nearest city they have been possessed and are hunting them, and they only just managed to get away. Any powers you bring to bear show that they believe what they're saying, but if you use anything that somehow shows objective truth you receive inconclusive, nonsensical or no results<br /> <br /> <b>180 b)</b>You don't have long to talk, though. As the night wears on, things start turning up - animated corpses and twisted servants of the Machine, although no angels. Any attempt to leave the gas station runs you into what seems to be some kind of spatial distortion - not matter what you do you seem trapped in a bubble of space where if you leave from one side you find yourself at the other. You defeat these things (and notice that for some reason no matter how egregiously you act outside your Cover it remains stable so long as the Compromise isn't caused by direct witness a supernatural power), although they whittle down the refugees one by one until only the pregnant woman remains. Finally, just before dawn, she gives birth and dies doing so, leaving you with a child on your hands, a very confusing night and a number of human and not-so-human corpses.<br /> <br /> <b>180 c)</b> And then the other shoe drops, in the form of something that looks a great deal like an angel but isn't - a man with wings of steel, superhuman physique and a conviction that he is the angel Gabriel, sent by God to retrieve the child. If you defeat him, his wings vanish, but no matter what he will not tell you the importance of the child.<br /> <br /> <b>180 d) </b>Where do you go and what do you do now? The spatial distortion vanished with the dawn, so you can leave, but this was so obviously a setup of the Machine that it could be no clearer if it were shouted from the rooftops. You were trapped; why did It not finish you off? What if the occult matrix is still ongoing, and whatever you decide to do next or with the child (who may be a Stigmatic, Offspring, Latent, Fractal, Nephilim or something stranger) is simply a continuation of whatever that was the night before? Perhaps most chillingly, what will you find when you return to civilisation? What if the refugees' claims were not some memory-trick of the Machine, but in fact real? Perhaps an entire city has been overrun by angels, spirits or something else. Maybe the world. Or maybe it's all just a fabrication. Who knows? (coughtheStorytellercough)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 09-02-2018, 04:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-31T21:24:26-07:00","id":1250401,"title":"","content":"181. The scooters appeared overnight. They are brightly-colored and easy to use. Their electric motors are good for the Earth. They are on street corners, in parking lots, in alleyways. It's a convenient way to get around town, some say. They never break down. They're always fully charged.<br /> <br /> Not everyone who rides off on a scooter makes it to their destination, though. Where do they end up instead?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T10:35:07-07:00","id":1250480,"title":"","content":"182: The free medical clinic will do outpatient surgeries for the poor. One doctor specializes in oncology. While her bedside manner is a bit odd, she has saved dozens of lives and freed more from crippling pain. She provides state-of-the-art medical care to those who could never afford it. She is a veritable angel...<br /> <br /> Each tumor she removes turns out to contain within its fleshy pouch, a gear made of bone and iron. After it is cleaned of blood, each gear is found to be unusually but perfectly shaped as if machined to a micrometer tolerance. They have odd, disquieting shadows as if they also project in a fourth direction perpendicular to the normal three dimensions. <br /> <br /> Perhaps you learn of this when a friends is shot and a gear shows up on their x-ray in an emergency room. Or a doctor friend of yours mentions a very strange case in passing, and then dies under suspicious circumstances. Or a pact recipient who now has money to travel (thanks to the pact) complains about setting off metal detectors in airports. <br /> <br /> Every week brings in one or two new parts. Who or what is inducing the tumors? What is the doctor constructing from these parts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T21:16:28-07:00","id":1250639,"title":"","content":"183: As you wait for the other Unchained in your ring to meet you in the city plaza, you are wracked by a whole body, convulsive cough. The cough is painful and afflicts you with some negative condition. Fellow demons in your ring report similar experiences when they show up. The cause seems to be cigarette smoke, but only from a particular brand.<br /> <br /> Upon investigation you find that printed on the *inside* of the paper cylinder of these cigarettes is one of the five Sumerian names for the Godmachine, using ink made from unborn children. <br /> <br /> Who is manufacturing these cigarettes? Can they be stopped before demons throughout the city are hurt? Or can the Infrastructure making the cigarettes be suborned into producing something that is a bane to angels?<br /> <br /> Rumor has it that they are opening a chain of vaping shops as well...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T04:53:37-07:00","id":1252179,"title":"","content":"184)<br /> The Setup<br /> One of the ring comes into contact with a Vampire one evening. Besides the obvious consequences of the discovery of the undead \u2013 more disturbing is that the Vampire is setting off your Aetheric Resonance.<br /> Meanwhile a person is found dead in their home. Their is no sign of entry into their house, only their window smashed open from the Inside. Their body looks like it was detonated from the inside and something burst out of her chest.<br /> Not far from the scene of the crime a homeless person is found shriveled and dead, their body drained of blood.<br /> <br /> Interchangeable Parts<br /> Demons will soon track down that the Vampire had a close encounter with this woman \u2013 did they feed from them? Where they a part of their herd? A ghoul of the vampire in question? <br /> The person has recently undergone a serious medical procedure, kidney replacement, IVF or Cancer Surgery supplied by a new Hospital in town.<br /> Something was left in the Person, and once it reacted to the Vampires interference it\u2026 changed.<br /> <br /> The Hooks<br /> How will this vampire deal with the revelation that their food supply may be tainted?<br /> Who is this medical company and what is their connection to the God-Machine?<br /> Where is the Creature that escaped?<br /> How many more people has the hospital done this too?<br /> <br /> I ran a variation of this hook from the Vampire POV. The secret being that the new IVF clinic in town was using humans as Incubators for new Angels for a long-term project, and the still forming Angel reacted poorly with Vitae being added to its system. It mutated and burst its way out of the mother Alien Style and became a monstrous Angel/ Vampire hybrid who fed on blood instead of Essence. Good for introducing some nasty body horror and crossover to the game while also telling a violent and quite visceral tale with a personal edge. Not quite for the feint hearted. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my Homebrew so far here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18X_mkFwDcM0sSN9R2GoQ72Q5FqW1deFgEM3HIGneABQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> So far its Demon Merits, Vampire 1e to 2e ports and a Knowledge collection mechanic for the Ordo Dracul!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24597-lordofiron","name":"LordofIron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24597_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T13:27:32-07:00","id":1252330,"title":"","content":"<ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">185: Road Infrastructure: </span></span><ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">There were 650,000 missing people in the US last year. This is not a made-up statistic. Check the Web.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">There are seven cars on the ring road around your city. They are always on the road.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">Each driver drives 24 hours a day, without sleeping. </span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">Eventually, they pick up a hitchhiker.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">The driver dies, is dumped by the hitchhiker, who becomes the new driver. </span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">The path the cars take is the same. They are tracing out something.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">Their path meshes with a counter-rotating path of truckers. </span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\">Are the cars cryptids? Angels? What happens if the cycle is broken? Are they keeping something in? Something out? Are they gears in some occult machine?</span></span></li> </ul></li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24502,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","user":"KieranMullen","date":". 09-12-2018, 11:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T20:32:01-07:00","id":1253787,"title":"","content":"186: <i>Stalking horse:</i> Someone is systematically hunting down pact-bound humans and killing them. These aren't penny-ante patch pacts - these are full Soul pacts of the highest quality futilely wasted, like someone burning the food stocks in a famine. Who would do such a thing?<br /> <br /> The Agency doesn't know, but the head of Agency Security wants you to find out. She will, off the books, <i>give</i> you a top-of-the-line cover. No one must know that you now own the Cover, certainly no one in the <i>Agency</i>. Your job is to collect the Cover and masquerade as that human. and wait to see who comes to kill you. You get a Cover with a 10 rating for free. You just have to survive.<br /> <br /> You'll have to observe the mark before you collect on the pact - get info and make sure you can maintain the Cover. Maybe watch to see if the mark is being watched. Maybe set up a trap or precaution or two. But don't fall in love with the mark, of course. Do you tell others in your Ring to get help? What if one of them is the killer? <br /> <br /> Who would kill pact-bound humans? Integrators? Angels? A new type of Cryptid? The GM? How do they know that these humans are in Soul pacts? Are all Soul-pacts in danger?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T01:54:00-07:00","id":1255203,"title":"","content":"187: Black Cat Crossing<br /> <br /> There has been a rash of people being moved - not simply being shoved from one side to the other, but people vanishing and then reappearing at the other side of entire town in a very short amount of time. The cause has already been identified as a black cat, so black it looks like a shadow even when in full daylight, but with eyes that move like backlit liquid amber. Each moving happens the same way: someone feels something against their leg, and upon looking down they see the brief outline of a cat; the moment their gaze hits those amber eyes, they find themselves in a place without any light, no sounds or even smells, just the afterimage of those eyes staring back at them. Then, after at most twenty minutes, they find themselves on the other side of town near what turns out to be known Infrastructure.<br /> <br /> What\u2019s odd is that nobody can figure out why this is being done. Nobody comes away hurt, or even with a lack of memory, nothing goes missing, and even Demons who have been moved have reported no aether being stolen from them. It doesn\u2019t even seem to be fulfilling any form of security on Infrastructure - most of the Infrastructure it appears by have actually featured stronger security than before its appearances, and there are rumors of faceless cat catchers being on patrol. The cat is simply taking people across town without any prompting, without any apparent rhyme or reason.<br /> <br /> So why is everyone on both sides so worried?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-18T20:43:55-07:00","id":1255414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 187: Black Cat Crossing<br /> <br /> There has been a rash of people being moved - not simply being shoved from one side to the other, but people vanishing and then reappearing at the other side of entire town in a very short amount of time. The cause has already been identified as a black cat, so black it looks like a shadow even when in full daylight, but with eyes that move like backlit liquid amber. Each moving happens the same way: someone feels something against their leg, and upon looking down they see the brief outline of a cat; the moment their gaze hits those amber eyes, they find themselves in a place without any light, no sounds or even smells, just the afterimage of those eyes staring back at them. Then, after at most twenty minutes, they find themselves on the other side of town near what turns out to be known Infrastructure. </div> </div> </div>So is this an unknown Cryptid? Or do you not have a specific plot resolution in mind?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T07:05:53-07:00","id":1255477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KieranMullen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1255414#post1255414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So is this an unknown Cryptid? Or do you not have a specific plot resolution in mind?</div> </div> </div> </div>The original idea was a cryptid using an adaptation based on Solitary Confinement, but there are a lot of different options. It can be an Exile muddying the waters, an Angel playing a very long game with Demons of the area, or even a Demon who managed to get a strange Cover. It could even just be a Horror who can sense aether that simply looks like a cat.<br /> <br /> As for a resolution, there is none in mind. However, the cat is unaffiliated with either side, capturing and releasing people, is somehow moving from one end of town to the other with great speed and releasing people near active Infrastructure. It has <i>some</i> reason for doing this, and many that spring to mind aren\u2019t nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T11:48:03-07:00","id":1258004,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">This is more of a plot then a plot hook. I apologize in advance for the long post.<br /> <br /> <br /> The published scenarios I have seen for DtD don\u2019t seem like espionage fiction to me. They lack that the double and triple crosses, the boss with an ambiguous agenda, and similar uncertainties. Below is a lengthy sketch of a chronicle I\u2019d like to run. I am posting it here for constructive criticism, especially a check on its consistency. By consistency I mean whether or not the different antagonists have far simpler and more sensible courses of action than the ones I give them. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The players\u2019 Ring is approached by a mysterious demon I\u2019ll call Smith. They are offered a job: there is going to be an auction of powerful Gadgets by humans who don\u2019t know all of the real powers of most of the Gadgets. One item, the McGuffin, is very important: it can greatly increase the probability that an angel will Fall, by sabotaging communication with the GM. The PC\u2019s are to either steal or purchase the McGuffin. They are welcome to obtain any of the other items they wish as a bonus. One in particular is a Aether battery, which would be valuable to any demon PC.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The auction is held in an isolated and warded mansion. There\u2019s no access to Twilight, and there are other special protections. To sneak into the auction Smith will provide the PC\u2019s with two identities, Brad and Janet. Brad is a multi-millionaire (via Pact) stigmatic and Janet, who is unconscious when presented to the PC\u2019s, is to be his beautiful escort. Brad is a GM cultist who </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>thinks</i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> he is helping the GM. (This is a deception the PC\u2019s must maintain). He has the Sleeve Integrator merit, so that one demon can drag on his form. Janet is to be Possessed via a Gadget. Brad has an invitation to the auction, and the PC\u2019s are told to use Brad and Janet to sneak in. They will find a way to sneak in any other PC\u2019s, buy or steal the McGuffin, and get out.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">There will be a variety of antagonists at the auction - one will be an uber-mage, one will be a vampire, there will be a trio of cultists and there will be assorted well-armed bodyguards and alarms. Standard sneaky stuff ensues, such as exchanging a fake McGuffin for a real one. Oh, there will also be one angel, in Cover (call him Fred). </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Deception 1: The McGuffin doesn\u2019t cause angels to fall. It\u2019s a trap by the GM to lure in demons. The McGuffin, when activated will turn into an Aether devouring cryptid. It\u2019s designed to be a demon killer. The GM is testing it out and Fred is there to see how it works. Once it is activated the mansion is sealed off from reality and everyone is trapped. The cryptid is really good at tracking demons and feeding off them.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fred will give the PC\u2019s an excuse to activate the McGuffin so that it will transform and eat them. However it will eat the Vampire by a lucky coincidence and change into something far more dangerous. Now it wants to eat </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>everyone</i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, and can attack angels as well. Victims might become new cryptids or something. It\u2019s bad. The GM did not predict this.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Deception 2: Smith knows it\u2019s a trap. He\u2019s not stupid. However, there are valuable gadgets there and he wants to find out the GM\u2019s plan. Even if the PC\u2019s are slaughtered, he\u2019s simply fooled the GM into thinking he\u2019s gullible. But he\u2019d rather they weren\u2019t, so Smith chose Brad and Janet on purpose. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Deception 2a: Janet is a mage, who is there involuntarily. At some point if the player pops out of Janet it will be clear she is first disoriented and soon is very pissed. Because she entered the mansion possessed by a demon, she didn\u2019t set off any magical alarms because </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>she wasn\u2019t a mage then, she was a demon</i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. Something about her will narratively make it useful to have her there. (She may be the counter to the uber-mage). She is a hostile ally to the PC\u2019s but they are innocent - they didn\u2019t know she was kidnapped. Now she\u2019s stuck there with them with Eaty McEatFace the cryptid.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Deception 2b: Smith knows that Brad is someone very important to Fred. Fred was Brad\u2019s guardian angel and was pulled off that assignment by the GM for this mission. Fred wants desperately to protect Brad, and will collaborate with the players to kill the cryptid and any of the other auction participants who get too greedy. If the players are clever, they might find a way to use this to induce Fred to Fall as well. Again, the PC\u2019s are innocent of kidnapping, and might be able to explain that to Fred.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Deception 2c: Smith has at least one other hidden actor at the auction - perhaps another demon. Will the PC\u2019s trust them? Will they trust Fred? But it might be a non-demon as well.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fred won\u2019t drop the wards while the cryptid is alive - it will eat angels and demons and everyone else if allowed to reproduce. The demons have to find a way to kill the cryptid, handle the uber-mage, and still steal the valuable gadgets. Finding a balance so that the threats are severe but not overwhelming will be difficult.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I want the PC\u2019s to feel that Smith yanked them around, but in a justifiable way so that they are annoyed but not furious. Smith got the PC\u2019s allies and resources at the auction in a way that gives the PC\u2019s deniability. He didn\u2019t know about the cryptid, just that it was some form of a trap being run by Fred. There are deceptions but no soap opera style twists. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-standard\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I am not sure what to do if the demons revert to their normal Covers in Fred\u2019s presence, since that means the GM will know who they are - if Fred tells the GM. I have to think of a way to fix this plot complication.<br /> <br /> <br /> If you've read this far, thank you! Feedback is welcome.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-01T07:39:03-07:00","id":1264032,"title":"","content":"<b>189) For Heaven is Empty</b><br /> A month ago, buildings and sites all over the world began to activate. Stonehenge rebuilt itself and pulsed with white and ultraviolet light, even as the Pyramids screamed in radio waves. Big Ben tolled out infrared C# while the Burj Khalifa sang microwave hymns to the cosmos. Naturally, panic spread, both among mortals and among the Unchained - what Infrastructure was this? What was its intention? Hasty saboteur-teams were assembled and hits were made, but it's unclear whether they succeeded or failed in disrupting the Machine's plan. The end result was subtly apocalyptic, either way: the structures flared one last time, and then the Machine went silent. No Infrastructure has been begun since, no angel summoned and no cult visited, save by the angels dispatched before the disaster. All remaining angels have become Exiles - those that haven't Fallen, at least. Compromise is much harder to cause; using Embeds and Exploits no longer erodes Cover, and neither does remaining in full Demonic Form (though entering it still inflicts Compromise as normal).<br /> <br /> It's a time of confusion, both for the mortal world and that of the Unchained. As scientists, leaders and religious authorities of all stripes strive to deliver answers to the people regarding the Event, the Unchained all have a single question on their minds: Is the Machine really gone? Is it some elaborate hoax, a trick to lure the Unchained out of hiding? As time wears on and the Machine remains silent, Rings and Agencies are beginning to become bolder, and tentatively look towards a future without the Machine. Infrastructure is being suborned left and right as demons begin to move more openly, while others look further ahead and fear what will happen when all Infrastructure has been claimed and no more is produced. The flood of Exiles are banding together as well, many Falling due to the stresses of free existence, but even among these many remain loyal to their absent god.<br /> <br /> War is coming, and mortals may be a third side in the conflict, given the fact that the ever-present threat of hunter-angel squads is no longer present to keep Unchained heads down. The stage seems set for a war for the throne of Hell.<br /> <br /> <u>Note:</u> This <i>is </i>a plot hook, but it's chronicle-defining in the most basic sense. Also, it probably only works in a WoD where G-M juju is the only juju, or where non-G-M juju is limited to ghosts, psychic powers, one-off Horrors, mortal occultism and that sort of thing. One suggestion I'd make is to have it so that mortals can, unconsciously, tap into Embeds in some way, enabling <i>Matrix: Reloaded</i>-type shenanigans. However you run this, it'll probably end up rather more... action or political thriller than horror-movie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 11-03-2018, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-05T01:42:44-08:00","id":1264707,"title":"","content":"190) Sometimes all you need is Google Maps and Streetview for a plothook. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://image.ibb.co/bDYpHf/Capture.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <br /> <br /> <br /> (<a href=\"https://www.google.de/maps/@41.7589425,-87.5692186,3a,75y,358.52h,106.36t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sZHP93QtnQzeZYVXG3QkNfw!2e0!7i13312!8i6656\" target=\"_blank\">Link to exact location</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24377-wayward-isabel","name":"Wayward Isabel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-05T12:15:11-08:00","id":1264773,"title":"","content":"I'd love a collection of places like this so that I can drop them as clues to my players and have one of them look up on street view in Google maps. Got any others?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-06T06:05:51-08:00","id":1264938,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately not. I'd love a collection like that as well. I found this one by coincidence when prepping for a Requiem game and immediately thought &quot;Infrastructure!&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24377-wayward-isabel","name":"Wayward Isabel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-06T06:15:32-08:00","id":1264940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KieranMullen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1264773#post1264773\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd love a collection of places like this so that I can drop them as clues to my players and have one of them look up on street view in Google maps. Got any others?</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like this could easily be a thread of its own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T17:21:57-08:00","id":1268107,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wayward Isabel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1264707#post1264707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Sometimes all you need is Google Maps and Streetview for a plothook.<br /> <br /> (Image deleted).</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\">34\u00b009'35.6&quot;N 102\u00b029'13.4&quot;W</span></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">33.747252, -112.633853</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">37.563936, -116.85123</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">38\u00b029\u20190.16\u2033N 109\u00b040\u201952.80\u2033W</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">37.629562, -116.849556</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">37.401573, -116.867808</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">16.864841, 11.953808</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">35.141533, -90.052695</span></span></b><br /><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">44.525049, -110.83819</span></span></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Most of these are in the US. </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24502,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","user":"KieranMullen","date":".  I added a few more I snagged from the Web. 11-16-2018, 09:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-01T22:36:34-08:00","id":1272309,"title":"","content":"On a slightly related note:<br /> <br /> I'm writing a Chronicle that takes place in Oklahoma. Rather than map out small towns, fuel transfer stations or creepy farms, I've been using satellite views from Google maps. For example, the characters are fed that something odd happened at a location. Why <i>wouldn't</i> a demon google the location and look at the lay of the land? The images and actual locations help ground the game in the concrete, present. The players can see if a location is isolated or populated, plan their approach to the location or ask about some odd shaped building.<br /> <br /> For example, the players will be given the numbers <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">35.406334, -99.683020</span></span><br /> <br /> If the figure out that they are map co-ordinates and look in Google maps, they'll find a fuel transfer station. It's actually the location of some Infrastructure, invisible on the map but visible to a who demon visits the location. They can look online and see that the landscape is barren and that a stealthy approach might be difficult. They know how far it is from other locations in the game, and what that might mean in terms of the plot.<br /> <br /> Of course when they get there not everything will be exactly as it was on the map. Perhaps some buildings are burned down since the images were taken. And perhaps some of the images turn out to be completely misleading. After all, who is better at hacking electronic information than the GodMachine?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T16:18:48-08:00","id":1291285,"title":"","content":"I Have a plot hook too.<br /> <br /> An agent of your agency infiltrated a company controlled by the Deva Corporation or the Good-Machine itself to gather some intel.<br /> <br /> Now, the agent accomplished his mission, and your task is to extract and secure him and the gathered data. It's an easy job, what can go wrong?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-29T14:27:50-07:00","id":1315271,"title":"","content":"So, what is the<a href=\"https://hellraiser.fandom.com/wiki/Lament_Configuration\" target=\"_blank\"> Lament Configuration</a> (LeMarchand's Box from Hellraiser) in DtD? It would make an interesting Gadget. Does it connect to a Bolthole with some very unusual Imperatives?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-29T15:07:16-07:00","id":1315281,"title":"","content":"<b>192)</b> Something blew a major Occult Matrix, and various random Latents in a wide area have been... altered. It seems to have only affected Latents (not full Offspring or Fractals), and what it did was give them a random <i>Exploit</i>, making them close to living Exploited Gadgets. Warping varies, with some noticeably changed, and others still human seeming. So far, the Machine seems to be observing passively, and the local Agencies are doing similar. No one knows how long this status quo will continue, of when these miraculous new powers will made headlines.<br /> <br /> [This is also an excuse to run a Descent-flavored Supers game, Exploits being the superpowers.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-01T05:26:47-07:00","id":1333510,"title":"","content":"Does anyone have any ideas for plot hooks for a Mage/Demon crossover game? I've got an idea that the PCs have banded together for the sake of extra occult muscle and detection capabilities (on the demonic side) and access to the mother of all Mysteries (on the mage side), with both parts interested in trying to puzzle out some of the principles behind the Machine's workings.<br /> <br /> I'm wondering if it might be best to just define a location, Infrastructure and so on and let the players work out how they want to go about their investigation, throwing obstacles and dangers in their path as appropriate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 09-01-2019, 08:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-02T13:45:37-07:00","id":1333732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1333510#post1333510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone have any ideas for plot hooks for a Mage/Demon crossover game? I've got an idea that the PCs have banded together for the sake of extra occult muscle and detection capabilities (on the demonic side) and access to the mother of all Mysteries (on the mage side), with both parts interested in trying to puzzle out some of the principles behind the Machine's workings.<br /> <br /> I'm wondering if it might be best to just define a location, Infrastructure and so on and let the players work out how they want to go about their investigation, throwing obstacles and dangers in their path as appropriate.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>193)</b> The G-M has launched a new project, constructing a web of Defensive Infrastructure around some new project. The local Agency has been sharing gossip with the local Consilium/Assembly and learned this new project is around an Aedes - and has been blocking access to it. Demons are concerned, and Mages want access to &quot;their&quot; Mystery restored.<br /> <br /> [Sub-plots pending. Feel free to use this to establish complications limiting the Mages and/or Demons to force them to work together.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-04T22:30:37-07:00","id":1334048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1333510#post1333510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone have any ideas for plot hooks for a Mage/Demon crossover game? I've got an idea that the PCs have banded together for the sake of extra occult muscle and detection capabilities (on the demonic side) and access to the mother of all Mysteries (on the mage side), with both parts interested in trying to puzzle out some of the principles behind the Machine's workings.</div> </div> </div> </div>It might be fun to present Demons as an <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/OutsideContextProblem?from=Main.OutsideContextVillain\" target=\"_blank\">Outside Context Problem</a> to the mages. By that I mean that the threat to the mages should break the rules, because interactions with the GodMachine play havoc with paradox and all sorts of rules of magic. One thing I like about Demon is that, as powerful as the characters are, they have to be very, very careful or the GodMachine will squash them like bugs. Add to this the duplicity and ruthlessness of the spy novel and it makes for a very different feel to the game.<br /> <br /> For example, mages A and B are hanging out in a cafe and their old friend mage C wanders up to meet them. Suddenly SKReeeehtCH her chest splits open and metallic cables snake out attempting to ensnare A and B. No one else in the cafe even notices - some powerful Force has the incident screened. A and B try to do something and their magic sputters, and Mysterious Stranger D shows up, helps them barely escape from C, and says &quot;come with me if you want to live&quot;. (tm). <br /> <br /> Mysterious Stranger D explains that there is a Force hunting mages, harvesting them. This Force can detect significant use of magic. The Stranger warns them not to trust C if they see her again. Stranger D offers to help free C from the clutches of this Force, called the GodMachine by raiding the Harvesting Infrastructure.<ul><li>Can the mages trust any of their old friends? How can they be sure?</li> <li>If they tell the larger mage community, are they just drawing them into more danger?</li> <li>Does D really want to save C? If so, why are they bringing all those explosives? What are their true motives? Is D just using A and B for some other goal?</li> <li>What level of magic can the mages use and not have the GodMachine detect them? How pervasive is it?</li> <li>From the mages PoV, what are the Demons? What is this weird set of identities (Covers) they have? Who are they really?</li> </ul>The Demon characters need the Mages because (1) Demons are pretty squishy when in Cover, (2) they have to worry about cover, and (3) Mages are superb at finding things out. The Mages need the Demons because they don't know what is going on. The Demons have to be very careful with their Covers because revealing too much to the mages will compromise their Cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-05T03:01:54-07:00","id":1334057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KieranMullen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1334048#post1334048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It might be fun to present Demons as an <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/OutsideContextProblem?from=Main.OutsideContextVillain\" target=\"_blank\">Outside Context Problem</a> to the mages. By that I mean that the threat to the mages should break the rules, because interactions with the GodMachine play havoc with paradox and all sorts of rules of magic. One thing I like about Demon is that, as powerful as the characters are, they have to be very, very careful or the GodMachine will squash them like bugs. Add to this the duplicity and ruthlessness of the spy novel and it makes for a very different feel to the game.<br /> <br /> For example, mages A and B are hanging out in a cafe and their old friend mage C wanders up to meet them. Suddenly SKReeeehtCH her chest splits open and metallic cables snake out attempting to ensnare A and B. No one else in the cafe even notices - some powerful Force has the incident screened. A and B try to do something and their magic sputters, and Mysterious Stranger D shows up, helps them barely escape from C, and says &quot;come with me if you want to live&quot;. (tm).<br /> <br /> Mysterious Stranger D explains that there is a Force hunting mages, harvesting them. This Force can detect significant use of magic. The Stranger warns them not to trust C if they see her again. Stranger D offers to help free C from the clutches of this Force, called the GodMachine by raiding the Harvesting Infrastructure.<ul><li>Can the mages trust any of their old friends? How can they be sure?</li> <li>If they tell the larger mage community, are they just drawing them into more danger?</li> <li>Does D really want to save C? If so, why are they bringing all those explosives? What are their true motives? Is D just using A and B for some other goal?</li> <li>What level of magic can the mages use and not have the GodMachine detect them? How pervasive is it?</li> <li>From the mages PoV, what are the Demons? What is this weird set of identities (Covers) they have? Who are they really?</li> </ul>The Demon characters need the Mages because (1) Demons are pretty squishy when in Cover, (2) they have to worry about cover, and (3) Mages are superb at finding things out. The Mages need the Demons because they don't know what is going on. The Demons have to be very careful with their Covers because revealing too much to the mages will compromise their Cover.</div> </div> </div> </div>While that's great material, one bit I'm not really clear on is how the demons would be able to effectively help the mages without blowing their Covers entirely. I feel like they'd have to interfere beforehand, preventing the meeting, rather than intervene <i>in medias res</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-05T10:17:42-07:00","id":1334087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1334057#post1334057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While that's great material, one bit I'm not really clear on is how the demons would be able to effectively help the mages without blowing their Covers entirely. I feel like they'd have to interfere beforehand, preventing the meeting, rather than intervene <i>in medias res</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let the Demons\u2019 Covers run an occult shop, or maybe be something like supernatural investigators. Heck, have them be detectives so they can \u201cfind out what is going on by investigating this\u201d while appearing to keep an open mind. Let the Demons have a mundane ability to help alongside their true selves... and maybe just let the Mages in at some point, swallowing the compromise so that the Mages won\u2019t cause them compromise anymore (barring spreading that info anyways).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-05T17:42:32-07:00","id":1334118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1334057#post1334057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While that's great material, one bit I'm not really clear on is how the demons would be able to effectively help the mages without blowing their Covers entirely. I feel like they'd have to interfere beforehand, preventing the meeting, rather than intervene <i>in medias res</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demons <i>can</i> tell mortals about their identity, it just risks Compromise. They can tell them &quot;I am not human, and you and I both are fighting a common, other-worldly, powerful entity.&quot; That would result in a Compromise roll, but not destroy their Cover. Demons make similar disclosures all the time when they try to get a mortal to sign a pact of any sort.<br /> <br /> You are correct that if the Mage keeps picking at the Demon's Cover, investigating their details, this will result in more Compromise rolls. This could make for interesting game play though. The Demon might ask the Mage to back off, stating that they can't explain why. What does the Mage do? If the Cover collapses, the Demon might switch to a different Cover identity. How will the Mage react to a new face claiming to be the demon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-07T04:36:06-07:00","id":1334334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1334057#post1334057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While that's great material, one bit I'm not really clear on is how the demons would be able to effectively help the mages without blowing their Covers entirely. I feel like they'd have to interfere beforehand, preventing the meeting, rather than intervene <i>in medias res</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Burner Covers, <i>Occam's Razor</i>, <i>Context Matters</i>, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-18T04:18:54-08:00","id":1349308,"title":"","content":"<b>194)</b> A region's strongest Insurgent Agency has fallen, allowing the God-Machine to create a strong foothold in the area. Overnight Angels and Infrastructure have been encroaching on nearby small town and cities. The God-Machine's first step in its Urban Sprawl Occult Matrix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-12T19:07:34-07:00","id":1396097,"title":"","content":"The first one was inspired by a comment over on <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/977540-outside-of-emergencies-and-utility-why-would-you-ever-show-your-demonic-form\">this thread</a>, whilst the other stuck me while I was listening to/watching <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q2yzTcdPapQ\" target=\"_blank\">this video</a> and, for some reason, recalling the Unchained's ability to speak all naturally occuring languages that aren't artificially constructed (I <i>think</i>...).<br /> <br /> 195) <b>Town of Broken Spheres;</b> One of the Unchained has <i>somehow</i> managed to create a town, or some other similarly sized local, where Demons don't cause compromise when they assume Demonic Form! Unchained from all over are flocking there in order to actually relax for once. But many others are wondering if this isn't some sort of honeypot trap set by the GM, to lure them in and finally recycle them all.<br /> <br /> 196) <b>Unholy Tongue;</b> Rumours are spreading along the Unchained wires that a demon has invented a language that only those who've disconnected from the God-Machine can truly speak and understand, albeit with training. the PC(s) dismiss them at first, until their fellow demons start talking to each other in an odd tongue that they can only barely understand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-13T04:20:24-07:00","id":1396152,"title":"","content":"Why isn't this thread always on the first page ? It needs to be a sticky !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-13T19:28:41-07:00","id":1396280,"title":"","content":"Inspired by the multiplayer video game Evolve.<br /> <br /> 197) <b>The Hunt is On!</b> After an encounter with a particularly strange Angel, during which they mysteriously blacked out, a/the PC finds themself trapped inside a splinter that appears to be set in the middle of nowhere. Then they notice the flares and what appears to be some sort of space shuttle? No matter, since they\u2019re now being hunted by a team of four (4) Hunter Angels bearing down on them. Now... how to escape?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T12:02:26-07:00","id":1396709,"title":"","content":"<b>198) Hunters In Need</b>: Demon Hunters have been going to bars pretending to people in need in order to attract Demons to make pacts with. The Hunters will usually make one deal to verify the Demon is legitimate and then have other hunters ambush the demon once their identity is confirmed.<br /> <br /> <b>199) Wish Hunters: </b>Rumor has it that a hunter has been trapping Demons. At least one Demon has escaped, nearly drained of willpower, speaks of a prison where Demons are forced to make deals with humans against their will. The hunter is a lawyer and writes the pacts for other human clients.<br /> <br /> <b>200) Vengeful Hunter:</b> Rumor has it that a Demon Hunter who helps people look for family members who sold their soul. The Demon Hunter doesn't cut deals and believes killing Demons is the only way to allow the Soul Pact Human to pass on to Heaven.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T16:47:18-08:00","id":1429265,"title":"","content":"Sorry this took so long, had to do a bit of research on the differences between Fractals and Nephilim.<br /> <br /> <b>201) Fractallian Spawn of a(n Un-)Holy Union:</b> One of the PCs has recently had a child with their romantic/sexual partner. Now, they\u2019ve started to lose aether when around the little one. Not only that, but parts of their baby\u2019s body has started changing to match up with various Modifications and Technologies demonstrated in Unchained and Halo* physiology before turning back, and effects not dissimilar to a couple of embeds and an exploit (as chosen by the ST) have been occurring. It hasn\u2019t happened in front of their partner (well, <i>yet</i>, at least to their knowledge), but it\u2019s only a matter of time before they catch even a fleeting glimpse. And the GM\u2019s attention has, almost assuredly, already been attracted. How does the Ring deal with this?<br /> <br /> <b>201-A)</b> Said partner turns out to be a Halo! Though they're apparently torn between reporting the character to the GM, and retaining this life which they've grown fond of.<br /> <br /> <b>202) Papa Demon/Mama Devil:</b> The Fractal child of one, or more, of the PCs has acquired a romantic partner. A <i>mortal</i> romantic partner. <b><i><u>WHAT</u> <u>DO?!?!</u></i></b><br /> <br /> Alternatively; one of the PCs has recently acquired a romantic partner (naturally, mind, no Soul Pacts or Patchworking a Cover, or any other supernatural means of inducing feelings for that matter). Only to learn that said partner\u2019s the Fractal child of a local Arch-Demon Scale Unchained (Primum eight (8) or nine (9) minimum) who\u2019s a <i>very</i> high-ranking member of one of the more powerful local Agencies (or even two such Unchained, though it depends on ST fiat if they're part of the same Agency, or completely different ones). *gulp*<br /> <br /> *In this context, I'm using the term 'Halo' to refer to Angels in the same way that 'Unchained' refers to Demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 12-31-2020, 10:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-07T09:59:52-07:00","id":1442988,"title":"","content":"24. Demons players get hunted by angels but they don't work for the god-machine. They learn that they fell just like them but connected themselves to another higher power that has now become interested in them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-05T13:39:49-07:00","id":1462831,"title":"","content":"<b>204 - The Infant Motor</b><br /> Have you ever heard of John Murray Spear? He was a clergyman, an abolitionist and a spiritualist, back in the 1850s. He claimed to claimed to be in contact with a group of spirits he called the 'Association of Electrizers'. Under the direction of these spirits (mostly various dead scientific personalities, including but not limited to Benjamin Franklin and Thomas Jefferson) he and a number of followers went to a town in Massachusetts to start building what they called alternately 'the New Messiah', 'the New Motive Power' and 'the Infant Motor'; a mechanical Second Coming meant to usher in a utopian era. They built the thing over nine months, then had a 'New Mary' (we don't know who this woman was) ritualistically 'birth' a spirit for the contraption they'd put together.<br /> <br /> It's obviously a God-Machine plot; the Association of Electrizers were clearly angels or an angel, and the Infant Motor just <i>reeks</i> of Infrastructure. After it was 'born', though, all it seemed to do was occasionally move some of the spheres it was composed of - plenty of disappointed witnesses attested to such - and eventually it was destroyed by a Baptist mob who thought it was heresy, after it was moved to New York. Or so Spear claimed.<br /> <br /> <b>204.a:</b> <b>All Grown Up</b><br /> Spear lied. The New Motive Power was never destroyed; it was just moved to some secret location, and it remains an important piece of Command and Control infrastructure to this day. Its exact location is hidden, and undoubtedly it's guarded by angels and stranger things besides - but perhaps its location can be traced from Spear's later writings. Something like that's got to be important - and at the very least, keeping tabs on C&amp;C Infrastructure is never a bad thing.<br /> <br /> <b>204.a.1:</b> <b>In the Beginning</b><br /> The Infant Motor is far more than merely C&amp;C Infrastructure. It was the infant form of the God-Machine itself, born under the hands of spiritualists, and saved by its nascent designs. Any signs of its activity prior to this point are either trickery and Concealment Infrastructure at work to obscure the timeline of its vulnerable, embryonic stage, or the result of the Machine propagating itself through time. If there were some way to return to this point in time, however, there is nothing that could not be accomplished - or risked. Who can say what enslaving, kidnapping, destroying or altering the infant God-Machine would result in. Perhaps deliverance. Perhaps annihilation.<br /> <br /> <b>204.b: Scapegoat</b><br /> The New Messiah's purpose has long since been fulfilled. It was never meant as anything more than a sacrifice; an effigy of the God-Machine, built to attract attention and to be destroyed, the news of this destruction supernaturally magnified and embedded into the human psyche, inuring mortal minds to the idea that a God-Machine remains. If its plans could be uncovered, and the Infant Motor rebuilt, though, perhaps that might undo its effects, revealing sections of the Machine's workings. Whether this is a good idea is a debate in itself, but its implications could be anything from a new crop of Stigmatics to a backlash against the Machine great enough to make a real change.<br /> <br /> <b>204.c: There Will Come a Child</b><br /> The Infant Motor wasn't a creation of the God-Machine at all. Rather, it was the first, faltering attempt of a Ring, Murray's 'Association of Electrizers' at creating their own Infrastructure, using a mortal puppet to create an extra layer of deniability. Their machine failed, or was sabotaged, or destroyed - but perhaps if you could track down their designs (or maybe even the Electrizers themselves, if any still survive) the project could be attempted again. Perhaps the Unchained can make their own savior.<br /> <br /> For more info on the New Motive Power (yes, it was real), see here: <a href=\"https://www.lorepodcast.com/episodes/61\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.lorepodcast.com/episodes/61</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Murray_Spear\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Murray_Spear\" target=\"_blank\"> John Murray Spear - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Murray_Spear\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Murray_Spear </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://mysteriousuniverse.org/2014/06/the-bizarre-mechanical-messiah-of-john-murray-spear/\" target=\"_blank\">https://mysteriousuniverse.org/2014/...-murray-spear/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 10-05-2021, 08:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T05:47:50-07:00","id":1464580,"title":"","content":"<b>205 - The Nail</b><br /> It's common knowledge that the obelisk downtown, carted in from Egypt back in the 1910s, is Infrastructure. It's got that aura of Aether, and it's got an urban mythos around its 'curse' that the Unchained have long since linked back to a guardian angel assigned to it. No new sightings or instances of 'the curse' have been reported in almost a year now, though, and all signs point to the disappearance of the angel. Fallen, maybe, recalled or something else. Whatever the case, the Infrastructure seems to be open to suborning. <br /> <br /> That's the rub, though. Obviously, it could be some kind of trap, but if that was the Infrastructure's only purpose that's a hell of a wait for a payoff. And there's news reports from around the time of the obelisk's installation of disturbances, disappearances and even sightings of some kind of monster in the area. There's been no disappearances or sightings yet, but the city has suffered multiple low-level earthquakes over the last year. The only real way to know, would be to descend into the sewers and other tunnels beneath the streets, and find out what it is, exactly, that the Nail was meant to pin in place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-22T04:55:00-07:00","id":1464858,"title":"","content":"<b>206 - Our Lady of Rapture</b><br /> We have spent a lot of time and effort tracking weather, building ships bigger and stronger and mapping the ocean, yet ships still go missing. They founder in storms, run off-course, suffer catastrophic breakdowns. And sometimes, those who make it out of such a disaster spy, far-off, a tall, dark tower with a light at the tip. Lifeboats row towards it, hoping for rescue, but when they reach the strange lighthouse they find it empty, and stairs only leading down into the craggy rock on which it stands. A strange, siren song, modulated precisely to stimulate curiosity and suppress fear, draws them downwards into the depths of this strange Facility. Space bends, and before long beyond the portholes the stranded men see spires belching black smoke into the water - somewhere between chimneys and volcanic vents. Strange creatures swim outside, lit by the red fires and the stark lighting of the Facility. Finally, they are met by the inhabitants of this domain, the machine-angels who will be the caretakers of their transformation, and by then it is too late. They will be tranquilized and modified, electrodes inserted carefully into the skull to stimulate activity and counteract the effects of soul-loss, while those extracted souls will be put to use as components in the the more esoteric products of this deep-sea factory.<br /> <br /> At the heart of all this sits the archangel her brain-numbed minions call the Principality of the Abyss, the Cold Ocean Womb, or Our Lady of Rapture. She - insofar as she has gender - presides over all the workings of this Facility, and acts as a holy medium between the God-Machine and Its undersea operations. Her children manipulate the courses of sea-storms and hurricanes, and mine resources from the sea-bed to build the Machine's great projects. She is privy to secrets of the Machine shared by few others, and her power is enormous. If she could be destroyed, or made to Fall, though, what a Hell her Facility would make.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T14:17:31-07:00","id":1465043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1464858#post1464858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>206 - Our Lady of Rapture</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Huh... interesting. Let me guess, the Bioshock franchise was your main inspiration for this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T15:24:27-07:00","id":1465050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1465043#post1465043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Huh... interesting. Let me guess, the Bioshock franchise was your main inspiration for this?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, no! Or, at least, not entirely. The basic idea came from a demon TenfoldShields wrote up here for Exalted, Mazscyllic here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15-_CJAG5L3RHvdpEIVBiEqlyWIpVQcgVkltPrafui8g/mobilebasic#h.qhbfmcqstp8p\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...h.qhbfmcqstp8p</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T15:46:28-07:00","id":1465053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1465050#post1465050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, no! Or, at least, not entirely. The basic idea came from a demon TenfoldShields wrote up here for Exalted, Mazscyllic here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15-_CJAG5L3RHvdpEIVBiEqlyWIpVQcgVkltPrafui8g/mobilebasic#h.qhbfmcqstp8p\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...h.qhbfmcqstp8p</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Huh... well, the influence is definitely stronger than you likely first anticipated, since I had literally no idea that such a work existed until now, and I mentally jumped to Bioshock almost as soon as I finished reading.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T17:07:19-07:00","id":1465065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1465053#post1465053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Huh... well, the influence is definitely stronger than you likely first anticipated, since I had literally no idea that such a work existed until now, and I mentally jumped to Bioshock almost as soon as I finished reading.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there is some Bioshock in there. It was just that I kinda wrote it down first, then thought &quot;Hey, I accidentally did a Bioshock&quot;, and kinda went back to edit things to fit that reference a little better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-07T07:22:02-08:00","id":1469832,"title":"","content":"<b>207) Unintended Chaosquences:</b> Various pieces of infrastructure, all connected by a God-Machine cover company based around storing and transporting goods, have recently started to rapidly, and randomly, oscillate between extreme levels of efficiency and being almost completely shut down. No one in the local demon community knows the cause, and rumours of the Machine\u2019s own agitation over the issue are also spreading. It falls to the PCs to go in and investigate the cause, and whether it could become a threat to the Unchained. Or perhaps even an asset?<br /> <br /> Twist #1: An autist who recently joined the company in an administrative function is the cause of all the ruckus, born of their various genuine attempts to streamline the company\u2019s ability to respond to what they see as the rather strange orders of some eccentric client/customer or another with suitable speed and efficiency, to varying degrees of success and failure. They also, at least outwardly, seem to genuinely believe that the company is a mortal, if odd, organisation.<br /> <br /> Twist #2: The autist has managed to piece together just enough to realise that <i>something</i> weird is going on, and is investigating out of a desire to ensure the company\u2019s ongoing safety and profitability. Can\u2019t have people skimming money off of the tops of contracts or anything like that!<br /> <br /> <b>208) The Aetheric Shrine:</b> Rumours are abound of a strange piece of Infrastructure built in a fashion evocative of a shrine or temple. What makes it so strange is that it seems to have no purpose beyond harvesting the local essence, converting it into Aether and subsequently storing the generated tech-gnostic energy. No-one knows what to make of it, but a mixed team/ring of Inquisitors and Saboteurs has been sent to investigate it as either a possible trap, or a valuable resource to be subverted against the God-Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-12T14:56:00-08:00","id":1470300,"title":"","content":"209: A destroyer angel sets up a grisly accident to kill a number of people but is partially foiled by a Stigmatic who saves themselves and several others. The destroyer is now hunting down the survivors and setting up Rube Goldberg deathtraps for them, in the order that they would have died in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11959-niknokk","name":"Niknokk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-13T01:15:47-08:00","id":1470332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Niknokk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1470300#post1470300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">209: A destroyer angel sets up a grisly accident to kill a number of people but is partially foiled by a Stigmatic who saves themselves and several others. The destroyer is now hunting down the survivors and setting up Rube Goldberg deathtraps for them, in the order that they would have died in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Final Destination? That was kind of genius.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-13T03:36:13-08:00","id":1470335,"title":"","content":"210) Unknown to the local unchained the god machine has had its hand in the design of every road, alley way or footpath within the city. It evaded detection until the last piece was completed. For until that moment it was simply mundane. Now the circuit is complete and it is coming online. Like a city scale glyph these routes of travel are beginning to have essence and aether flow along their routes but it's still warming up. There is still time to act before the output is produced. And so, the local unchained are scrambling to respond before it is too late.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-13T05:00:02-08:00","id":1470337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1470335#post1470335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">210) Unknown to the local unchained the god machine has had its hand in the design of every road, alley way or footpath within the city. It evaded detection until the last piece was completed. For until that moment it was simply mundane. Now the circuit is complete and it is coming online. Like a city scale glyph these routes of travel are beginning to have essence and aether flow along their routes but it's still warming up. There is still time to act before the output is produced. And so, the local unchained are scrambling to respond before it is too late.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;And that is why our streets are full of potholes.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-16T16:16:10-08:00","id":1470665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/111448-01000111-01101111-01100100-plot-hooks?p=1470337#post1470337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;And that is why our streets are full of potholes.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Darn Right it is full of potholes! Do you have any idea what the Creator could do with that much energy? Or what it would have been funnelling it towards? Just do the job and dig up the road at the designated spots on the map, unless you want the Agency to cut you off!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T08:06:51-08:00","id":1470855,"title":"","content":"<b>211)</b> The Demon/Ring is approached directly by Angels. They aren't here to fight or bring them back, but instead have an offer - Help the God-Machine complete some Infrastructure in a place Angels have difficulty operating (such as the Hedge) and they will be greatly rewarded.<br /> <br /> <b>212)</b> Demons have learned of a dire plot - a contagion will soon be unleashed that will slowly kill off humanity. But, and this is perhaps more troublesome, Demon-blooded - even Latents - are immune to it. The God-Machine wants to ensure only the offspring of its former agents eventually remain of humanity. Why, and how can It's designs be stopped?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 05-25-2022, 06:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-23T01:13:22-07:00","id":1481738,"title":"","content":"Spawned in a discussion today.<br /> <br /> 213) A bunch of demons found a way to abuse the Going Loud ability by somehow combining it with the Exploit Four minutes ago. Their Cover regenerate once the Exploit is used <br /> <br /> At first they used it to strike at the God-Machine with absolute impunity, then expend it on more trivial matters. Other demons are starting to get really worried, including the players. How long until the God Machine goes berserk and flood the city with Rank 5 killer angels ?<br /> <br /> And, more importantly, why does this combination suddenly works like that ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T23:49:20-07:00","id":1490488,"title":"","content":"214- A powerful Gadget lets you Go Loud without having your cover destroyed. Since the God Machine knows that Covers are destroyed when a Demon goes Loud, the Cover isn't even flagged-in fact, it makes you lose conditions like Flagged or Hunted since it assumes it made a mistake.<br /> <br /> After the Gadget arrived in the city diffferent Agencies have been fighting for it. The problem with fighting over a Gadget that let's you Go Loug without repercussions is that the Agents involved are using it and abusing it, and the GM has long noticed something is weird. And maybe, maybe, the Gadget was designed only as a last resort and using it so much on such a short period of time will have other consequences...<br /> <br /> The players might have different missions depending on their agency: maybe acquiring the Gadget o even destroying it, since it's too powerful. Of course, the tentation of keeping the Gadget for themselves is always there. Another angle is the tentation of escaping from the city, since the attention of both the GM and every Demon in the city is on the Gadget, so if things go hairy the players will have to consider: wil they run away, knowing they have an opening to do it safely? or will they risk it all, either for the good of the Agency or to acquire a powerful Gadget?<br /> <br /> (In case you're worried about giving such a powerful Gadget to the players, all fo this mess makes the GM reevaluate it's assumptions, so using the gadget shouldn't be as safe after the plot hooks is done. Maybe the user gains Flagged, maybe it gains a unique Condition, maybe it makes a more destructive Compromise roll, you lose Cover even on a success and a failure makes you lose 5 Cover.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","user":"Aeneas","date":". 08-21-2022, 05:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T02:52:06-07:00","id":1490857,"title":"","content":"214.5- Maybe there isn't one powerful Gadget-maybe it's a series of one shots. And that changes things pretty drastically.<br /> <br /> In the above plot hook, there was a shadow war between Agencies, a war that was supposed to be secret but has been slipping up and when the players enter the scene there isn't much secrecy yet. The God Machine has started to act, both because it has detected Demons to capture and to discover what the hell is happening.<br /> <br /> But with one shots the city is a powder keg from the start. Because there isn't only one Demon who can Go loud without consequences then you can bet that <i>someone</i> is gonna slip up sooner rather than later. And eventually they are gonna use it against another Demon. Soon, Demons feel unsafe and they are looking for this new kind of Gadget so that they can defend themselves.<br /> <br /> One Demon who Goes Loud too often rings the God Machines attention-a whole city of them is a declaration of war. The GM is gonna do whatever it can to destroy all Demons in the city AND find out what the hell is going on. The Agencies move but out of a frantic run for survival, not greed. Whoever is pushing this oneshots is a danger and has to be stopped. On the other hand, iwill they resist the siren song of the menas to craft their own &quot;Get out of Loud free&quot; cards?<br /> <br /> In 214, Agencies where players not to be trusted. Even the players Agency is using them as pawns in a dangerous, dangerous game. 214.5 on the other hand, the players fight hand in hand with their Agency to fight an evil capable of ending all the Demons in the city if it goes unchecked. Other Agencies share the same goal-but some distrust is inevitable. What if searching for clues both the palyers and Demosn from another Agency find a small cach\u00e9 of the one shots? What if it's just one? Are you willing to fight-to kill-for a small dose of awesome power?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T09:21:47-07:00","id":1543266,"title":"","content":"<b>215) Entropic 'Witch':</b> The PC Ring finds a young woman who, for unknown reasons, actively <i>radiates</i> an <i>aura</i> of <i><b>Pure Aether</b></i>! Following her usual activities, either through befriending her, or more... illicit... methods, eventually leads the PCs to a portal that leads into a completely different reality, not splinter, <b><i><u>Reality</u></i></b>, completely free of the God-Machine's influence, and one where none of the natives alert the Cosmic Engine when they see the true forms of the Unchained, despite their powers still being fully available.<br /> <br /> How is this happening? WHY is this happening?<br /> <br /> \u2026<br /> <br /> \u2026And what do the PCs <i>do</i> with this discovery?<br /> <br /> Inspiration: A Crossover Fanfiction Idea I had when reading a TOH AU fanfic where Luz was a Princess, and Amity her companion Knight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}